di rumahnya</b></font> <font color="#fff22f"><b>tiap malam?</b></font>

32
00:03:21.709 --> 00:03:23.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di dunia ini.</b></font>

33
00:03:23.709 --> 00:03:26.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ibu lakukan semampuku.</b></font>

34
00:03:27.376 --> 00:03:29.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku sudah pria dewasa. Ibu.</b></font>

35
00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:32.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Usir mereka keluar.</b></font>

36
00:03:32.626 --> 00:03:36.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Melanggar hukum Zeus. 
memberi alasan menyerangmu.</b></font>

37
00:03:41.959 --> 00:03:43.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ibu sudah kehilangan suami.</b></font>

38
00:03:44.626 --> 00:03:46.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ibu tak mau kehilangan putra.</b></font>

39
00:03:46.459 --> 00:03:49.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Ayah akan kembali.
- Di mana dia?</b></font>

40
00:03:49.542 --> 00:03:52.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sudah 8 tahun Troya runtuh</b></font>

41
00:03:52.292 --> 00:03:54.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan nyaris 20 tahun 
Ayahmu meninggalkan kita.</b></font>

42
00:03:54.459 --> 00:03:55.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di mana dia?</b></font>

43
00:04:06.542 --> 00:04:08.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia tamu kita. sama sepertimu.</b></font>

44
00:04:09.042 --> 00:04:10.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau anggap kami pengemis?</b></font>

45
00:04:10.459 --> 00:04:12.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kalian kami jamu selama 3 tahun.</b></font>

46
00:04:13.126 --> 00:04:16.242
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kami manfaatkan keramahanmu</b></font>

47
00:04:17.541 --> 00:04:19.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>karena ibumu menolak memilih.</b></font>

48
00:04:19.625 --> 00:04:22.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Dia sudah bersuami.
- Odisseus sudah mati.</b></font>

49
00:04:22.876 --> 00:04:24.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa tahumu soal ayahku?</b></font>

50
00:04:27.126 --> 00:04:29.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dagingnya alot dan anggurnya buruk.</b></font>

51
00:04:30.459 --> 00:04:32.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kalian minum yang terbaik 2 tahun ini.</b></font>

52
00:04:32.542 --> 00:04:34.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku tahu dia belum pulang.</b></font>

53
00:04:34.459 --> 00:04:35.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Belum.</b></font>

54
00:04:37.126 --> 00:04:39.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau menuntut sosok ayah</b></font>

55
00:04:39.209 --> 00:04:40.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>yang tidak pernah kau kenal</b></font>

56
00:04:40.876 --> 00:04:42.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>bagai anak haram cengeng.</b></font>

57
00:04:43.042 --> 00:04:45.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tiada yang pasti siapa ayahnya.</b></font>

58
00:04:45.792 --> 00:04:47.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau tak bisa pastikan ayahku.</b></font>

59
00:04:47.459 --> 00:04:48.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku mengenalnya.</b></font>

60
00:04:48.876 --> 00:04:51.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Masa kecil. kami melihat dia berburu.</b></font>

61
00:04:53.292 --> 00:04:55.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku relawan untuk Troya.</b></font>

62
00:04:55.459 --> 00:04:56.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia menyuruhku tinggal.</b></font>

63
00:04:57.042 --> 00:04:58.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>untuk menjagamu.</b></font>

64
00:04:59.542 --> 00:05:00.417
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Namun.</b></font>

65
00:05:01.459 --> 00:05:03.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sparta dipenuhi veteran Troya.</b></font>

66
00:05:04.126 --> 00:05:05.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>itu tambang informasi.</b></font>

67
00:05:05.959 --> 00:05:07.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau putra Odisseus?</b></font>

68
00:05:07.959 --> 00:05:09.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pergilah ke Sparta.</b></font>

69
00:05:09.876 --> 00:05:11.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>temui Menelaus.</b></font>

70
00:05:12.626 --> 00:05:13.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia akan menyambutmu.</b></font>

71
00:05:15.709 --> 00:05:18.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ratu ingin bicara dengan orang asing.</b></font>

72
00:05:19.209 --> 00:05:20.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia haus berita.</b></font>

73
00:05:23.626 --> 00:05:25.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Namun jangan memberi harapan palsu.</b></font>

74
00:05:25.292 --> 00:05:28.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia tahu cara memastikan orang 
melihat Odisseus.</b></font>

75
00:05:28.542 --> 00:05:29.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau lihat pria itu?</b></font>

76
00:05:30.042 --> 00:05:31.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia nyaris buta.</b></font>

77
00:05:31.792 --> 00:05:33.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>namun dia menghajar pengelana hingga mati</b></font>

78
00:05:33.876 --> 00:05:35.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>jika mereka bohong soal ayahku.</b></font>

79
00:06:03.542 --> 00:06:04.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Terburu-buru.</b></font>

80
00:06:05.292 --> 00:06:06.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tahu dari mana?</b></font>

81
00:06:06.542 --> 00:06:09.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tak butuh mata untuk mendengar
langkah ceroboh.</b></font>

82
00:06:10.209 --> 00:06:11.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mentor. senggol dia.</b></font>

83
00:06:19.959 --> 00:06:21.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Terburu-buru.</b></font>

84
00:06:30.792 --> 00:06:32.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia sama ramahnya denganmu</b></font>

85
00:06:33.292 --> 00:06:35.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia hanya patuh pada ayahmu!</b></font>

86
00:06:35.626 --> 00:06:36.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di mana ayah menemukannya?</b></font>

87
00:06:37.626 --> 00:06:39.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mereka bertemu di sini.</b></font>

88
00:06:48.542 --> 00:06:50.835
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Aku ambil dia.
- Untuk anakmu?</b></font>

89
00:06:51.209 --> 00:06:52.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Untuk berburu.</b></font>

90
00:06:54.288 --> 00:06:55.552
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Instingnya tajam.</b></font>

91
00:07:31.792 --> 00:07:32.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jangan gerak</b></font>

92
00:07:33.042 --> 00:07:35.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau mau lukanya buruk?</b></font>

93
00:07:36.573 --> 00:07:39.684
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Kenapa memetik talinya?
- Itu terhormat</b></font>

94
00:07:39.709 --> 00:07:42.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Memperingati mangsamu?
- Bertarung bermartabat</b></font>

95
00:07:42.626 --> 00:07:44.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau tidak bertarung. 
kau berburu.</b></font>

96
00:07:44.709 --> 00:07:46.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Berburu adalah tarung sembunyi-sembunyi.</b></font>

97
00:07:47.209 --> 00:07:50.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Cerdik. namun akal-akalanmu
akan membawa masalah.</b></font>

98
00:07:51.209 --> 00:07:52.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Coba lagi.</b></font>

99
00:07:52.876 --> 00:07:55.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>jangan buru-buru. lebih presisi.</b></font>

100
00:07:55.459 --> 00:07:57.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kita tak menang bermodal
pertahanan </b></font>

101
00:07:58.126 --> 00:07:59.351
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pancing serangannya.</b></font>

102
00:07:59.376 --> 00:08:00.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Bagaimana? 
- Ragu-ragulah.</b></font>

103
00:08:01.784 --> 00:08:06.286
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Buka celah untuk pedang musuh.
Serangannya menguntungkanmu.</b></font>

104
00:08:38.376 --> 00:08:40.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau ajarkan ini pada ayahku?</b></font>

105
00:08:40.458 --> 00:08:42.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia yang mengajariku.</b></font>

106
00:08:42.792 --> 00:08:43.851
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia bilang:</b></font>

107
00:08:43.876 --> 00:08:46.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>"Kau tak selalu jadi yang
terkuat atau tercepat.</b></font>

108
00:08:47.126 --> 00:08:49.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>maka jadilah yang tercerdik."</b></font>

109
00:08:49.876 --> 00:08:51.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa yang beliau lakukan.</b></font>

110
00:08:51.792 --> 00:08:53.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>mendapati para pelamar itu di rumahnya?</b></font>

111
00:08:54.126 --> 00:08:56.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tak terbayang 
apa yang akan dia perbuat.</b></font>

112
00:08:57.209 --> 00:08:58.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mereka banyak.</b></font>

113
00:08:58.709 --> 00:09:00.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Membunuh 2 orang. 
sisanya akan mundur.</b></font>

114
00:09:00.959 --> 00:09:02.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>para begundal pengecut itu.</b></font>

115
00:09:02.792 --> 00:09:06.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Harusnya mereka ke Troya.
tapi saat Agamemnon tiba.</b></font>

116
00:09:09.876 --> 00:09:11.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>ayah mereka menyembunyikannya.</b></font>

117
00:09:14.542 --> 00:09:19.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mengetahui perang Agamemnon akan
merenggut waktu dan nyawa.</b></font>

118
00:09:23.626 --> 00:09:25.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jadi. dia mengundi pasukannya.</b></font>

119
00:09:28.292 --> 00:09:29.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Nama? 
- Sinon.</b></font>

120
00:09:29.709 --> 00:09:31.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Ambil. 
- Tidak.</b></font>

121
00:09:31.376 --> 00:09:32.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Nama?
- Antinous.</b></font>

122
00:09:32.626 --> 00:09:33.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ambil.</b></font>

123
00:09:35.209 --> 00:09:36.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ya.</b></font>

124
00:09:36.376 --> 00:09:37.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Diundi?</b></font>

125
00:09:39.876 --> 00:09:41.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Antinous mengaku menjadi relawan.</b></font>

126
00:09:42.126 --> 00:09:43.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mereka merencanakan sesuatu.</b></font>

127
00:09:51.709 --> 00:09:53.876
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Putramu ingin menggantikan Sinon.</b></font>

128
00:09:54.709 --> 00:09:55.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mustahil.</b></font>

129
00:09:56.126 --> 00:09:57.750
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia tinggal di sini demi keluarga.</b></font>

130
00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:03.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Dia juga akan menjaga putramu.
- Pastinya</b></font>

131
00:10:07.404 --> 00:10:08.563
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia pergi denganku.</b></font>

132
00:10:09.042 --> 00:10:10.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ingin Antinous menjagaku?</b></font>

133
00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:12.351
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tidak. Tidak</b></font>

134
00:10:12.376 --> 00:10:15.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Odisseus tak mau 
mempermalukan ayah mereka.</b></font>

135
00:10:15.292 --> 00:10:16.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dia berbelas kasih.</b></font>

136
00:10:17.078 --> 00:10:19.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia lebih mencintaimu 
dan ibu dari pada pamor.</b></font>

137
00:10:21.542 --> 00:10:23.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia tahu ini akan memakan waktu 
bertahun-tahun.</b></font>

138
00:10:24.292 --> 00:10:25.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia bilang itu ke ibu?</b></font>

139
00:10:25.959 --> 00:10:27.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Tanyakan padanya.
- Eumaeus...</b></font>

140
00:10:28.959 --> 00:10:30.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia akan pulang?</b></font>

141
00:10:31.959 --> 00:10:33.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Argos percaya itu.</b></font>

142
00:10:33.542 --> 00:10:36.153
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Belum pernah melihat anjing hidup 20 tahun.</b></font>

143
00:10:36.959 --> 00:10:39.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia bertahan lama demi majikannya.</b></font>

144
00:10:56.126 --> 00:10:57.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Maaf menyela.</b></font>

145
00:11:00.959 --> 00:11:02.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ibu tidak buru-buru.</b></font>

146
00:11:03.542 --> 00:11:07.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kata Tetua. setelah kain kafan
kakekmu rampung.</b></font>

147
00:11:07.209 --> 00:11:08.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ibu wajib menikah lagi.</b></font>

148
00:11:08.792 --> 00:11:09.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mengapa?</b></font>

149
00:11:15.542 --> 00:11:17.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ithaca masih tanpa raja.</b></font>

150
00:11:18.376 --> 00:11:19.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mereka butuh perlindungan.</b></font>

151
00:11:20.042 --> 00:11:21.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dari apa?</b></font>

152
00:11:21.292 --> 00:11:22.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bangsa Laut.</b></font>

153
00:11:23.126 --> 00:11:25.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Itu cuma bualan pengelana.</b></font>

154
00:11:25.709 --> 00:11:29.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pengelana membawa kabar.
soal runtuhnya Troya.</b></font>

155
00:11:30.126 --> 00:11:33.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan semuanya membahas serangan
Bangsa Laut ini.</b></font>

156
00:11:34.626 --> 00:11:36.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Siapa Bangsa Laut ini?</b></font>

157
00:11:36.792 --> 00:11:39.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Entahlah. namun para Tetua
ingin kita bersiap.</b></font>

158
00:11:40.042 --> 00:11:41.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bersiap?</b></font>

159
00:11:41.292 --> 00:11:44.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Peradaban kita tercatat
paling agung.</b></font>

160
00:11:45.792 --> 00:11:47.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tatap rumah mulia ini.</b></font>

161
00:11:47.792 --> 00:11:49.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>batu-batu abadi ini.</b></font>

162
00:11:49.959 --> 00:11:53.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>jadi mangsa benalu rakus.</b></font>

163
00:11:53.959 --> 00:11:55.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bangunan ini tak berarti</b></font>

164
00:11:56.376 --> 00:11:58.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>bila maknanya dihina.</b></font>

165
00:11:58.792 --> 00:11:59.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hukum Zeus.</b></font>

166
00:12:01.042 --> 00:12:03.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Memperlakukan sesama dengan baik.</b></font>

167
00:12:03.542 --> 00:12:06.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mereka lecehkan itu. 
menghancurkan segalanya.</b></font>

168
00:12:06.876 --> 00:12:09.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sudi nian Ibu menikahi 
salah satunya?</b></font>

169
00:12:09.459 --> 00:12:11.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Karena dahulu kala.</b></font>

170
00:12:13.042 --> 00:12:14.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>ayahmu yang memintanya.</b></font>

171
00:12:15.292 --> 00:12:16.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Agamemnon raja kita.</b></font>

172
00:12:17.542 --> 00:12:21.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Troya merebut iparnya.
- Atau dia kabur bersama mereka.</b></font>

173
00:12:21.876 --> 00:12:26.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apapun itu.
tembok Troya tersohor mustahil tembus.</b></font>

174
00:12:26.542 --> 00:12:28.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kita akan berkemah di depan kota besar itu</b></font>

175
00:12:29.126 --> 00:12:31.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>memancing mereka keluar bertarung.</b></font>

176
00:12:33.376 --> 00:12:36.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tahun berganti.
Telemakus bertumbuh</b></font>

177
00:12:36.959 --> 00:12:39.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan kau belajar hidup tanpaku.</b></font>

178
00:12:39.376 --> 00:12:41.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Menelaus akan melupakan Helen.</b></font>

179
00:12:46.709 --> 00:12:48.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Itu cuma dalih Agamemnon</b></font>

180
00:12:48.709 --> 00:12:52.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>untuk mematahkan cengkeraman Troya
di jalur dagang.</b></font>

181
00:12:54.042 --> 00:12:56.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia pantang menyerah.</b></font>

182
00:12:56.542 --> 00:12:57.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mustahil.</b></font>

183
00:13:04.042 --> 00:13:06.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jika kau menolak?</b></font>

184
00:13:11.792 --> 00:13:13.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia akan merenggut putra kita.</b></font>

185
00:13:14.876 --> 00:13:16.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia tidak sekeji itu.</b></font>

186
00:13:16.542 --> 00:13:18.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia menumbalkan putrinya sendiri</b></font>

187
00:13:18.376 --> 00:13:20.523
<font color="#fff22f"><b>demi hembusan angin.</b></font>

188
00:13:21.459 --> 00:13:23.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Para dewa menginginkan nyawa putrinya?</b></font>

189
00:13:24.292 --> 00:13:26.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Nilai suatu pengorbanan</b></font>

190
00:13:27.542 --> 00:13:30.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>diukur dari kehilangan 
sang penumbal.</b></font>

191
00:13:33.209 --> 00:13:34.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Itu biadab.</b></font>

192
00:13:37.376 --> 00:13:38.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dan mutlak.</b></font>

193
00:13:41.709 --> 00:13:43.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku takkan segera pulang.</b></font>

194
00:13:44.292 --> 00:13:45.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>entah kapan bisa kembali.</b></font>

195
00:13:49.858 --> 00:13:51.237
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bagaimana jika kita kabur?</b></font>

196
00:13:52.876 --> 00:13:55.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>bawa pelaut terbaikmu.</b></font>

197
00:13:56.626 --> 00:13:58.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>kita berlayar menuju cakrawala...</b></font>

198
00:13:59.981 --> 00:14:01.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>saling bergandengan tangan.</b></font>

199
00:14:02.062 --> 00:14:03.974
<font color="#fff22f"><b>kita ke barat 
saat senja</b></font>

200
00:14:04.292 --> 00:14:05.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>memburu mentari.</b></font>

201
00:14:09.626 --> 00:14:11.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ada dunia di luar tembok ini.</b></font>

202
00:14:12.209 --> 00:14:14.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Balas dendam Agamemnon</b></font>

203
00:14:15.709 --> 00:14:17.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>akan menghancurkan Ithaca.</b></font>

204
00:14:23.542 --> 00:14:24.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Berjanjilah padaku.</b></font>

205
00:14:26.709 --> 00:14:28.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jika aku tidak pulang</b></font>

206
00:14:28.792 --> 00:14:30.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>sebelum Telemakus dewasa.</b></font>

207
00:14:31.542 --> 00:14:32.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>berjanjilah</b></font>

208
00:14:34.292 --> 00:14:35.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>untuk mencari suami baru.</b></font>

209
00:14:38.126 --> 00:14:39.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Cukup sudah pengorbanan.</b></font>

210
00:14:39.626 --> 00:14:40.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Cinta bukanlah pengorbanan.</b></font>

211
00:14:41.209 --> 00:14:42.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tentu saja iya.</b></font>

212
00:14:43.542 --> 00:14:44.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku ingin melindungimu.</b></font>

213
00:14:45.042 --> 00:14:46.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Itu bukan urusanmu.</b></font>

214
00:14:48.792 --> 00:14:50.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Berjanjilah padaku.</b></font>

215
00:14:56.126 --> 00:14:57.917
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau. berjanjilah untuk pulang</b></font>

216
00:15:03.126 --> 00:15:04.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bagaimana jika aku tak bisa?</b></font>

217
00:15:10.126 --> 00:15:12.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Maka. bukan kenanganmu
yang memutuskan nasibku.</b></font>

218
00:15:17.626 --> 00:15:18.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bawa brosku ini.</b></font>

219
00:15:19.542 --> 00:15:22.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>simpanlah selalu.
dan Athena akan membawamu pulang.</b></font>

220
00:15:23.209 --> 00:15:25.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tak yakin ini membuatku makin keren.</b></font>

221
00:15:27.376 --> 00:15:29.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jika ada musafir mengaku melihatmu.</b></font>

222
00:15:29.709 --> 00:15:31.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>aku akan tanya apa pakaianmu</b></font>

223
00:15:31.709 --> 00:15:33.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan aku akan tahu bila mereka dusta.</b></font>

224
00:15:36.376 --> 00:15:38.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jika Bangsa Laut itu nyata.</b></font>

225
00:15:39.542 --> 00:15:42.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>kini Ithaca tiada raja
untuk mengerahkan pasukan.</b></font>

226
00:15:43.709 --> 00:15:45.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku bisa ambil takhta itu.</b></font>

227
00:15:47.376 --> 00:15:48.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kemarilah.</b></font>

228
00:16:00.542 --> 00:16:01.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tarik talinya.</b></font>

229
00:16:12.459 --> 00:16:13.885
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ini tak adil!</b></font>

230
00:16:14.292 --> 00:16:16.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ibu bilang hanya Ayah yang mampu</b></font>

231
00:16:16.602 --> 00:16:18.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ayahmu membiarkan yang lain mencoba.</b></font>

232
00:16:20.876 --> 00:16:22.552
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ayahmu menyusun kapak-kapak...</b></font>

233
00:16:56.376 --> 00:16:58.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tak ada lagi yang pernah berhasil.</b></font>

234
00:16:59.209 --> 00:17:00.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>mereka memeras harta kita</b></font>

235
00:17:00.959 --> 00:17:04.717
<font color="#fff22f"><b>agar Ibu menikahi salah satunya
sebelum aku bertakhta.</b></font>

236
00:17:05.209 --> 00:17:07.790
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Menelaus sudah pulang bertahun lalu.</b></font>

237
00:17:08.562 --> 00:17:11.442
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Mereka semua pulang.
- Bagi yang selamat!</b></font>

238
00:17:12.684 --> 00:17:14.490
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mungkin Ayahmu sudah tewas</b></font>

239
00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:16.819
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kalau begitu. ini istanaku</b></font>

240
00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:19.184
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kita harus memastikannya</b></font>

241
00:17:19.209 --> 00:17:21.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan harusnya aku menemui Menelaus.</b></font>

242
00:17:22.041 --> 00:17:25.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>para pelamar itu 
berniat jahat padamu.</b></font>

243
00:17:25.959 --> 00:17:28.040
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ibu pikir aku tak tahu?</b></font>

244
00:17:28.376 --> 00:17:31.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tiap malam. 
mereka memancingku berbuat salah</b></font>

245
00:17:31.209 --> 00:17:34.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dan di luar sana. 
di lautan. di jalanan.</b></font>

246
00:17:35.126 --> 00:17:37.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>mereka akan membunuhmu 
tanpa ragu!</b></font>

247
00:17:39.792 --> 00:17:41.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ibu tak mau aku bertakhta.</b></font>

248
00:17:44.042 --> 00:17:48.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ibu ingin mengekang diriku
agar tetap menjadi ratu Ithaca.</b></font>

249
00:17:48.313 --> 00:17:51.226
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ibu muak 
menjadi ratu tanpa rajaku!</b></font>

250
00:17:51.376 --> 00:17:52.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tanpa raja Ibu?</b></font>

251
00:17:54.126 --> 00:17:55.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Atau seorang raja?</b></font>

252
00:17:56.876 --> 00:18:00.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dan kau merasa siap 
menggantikan ayahmu?</b></font>

253
00:18:01.876 --> 00:18:03.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau masih bocah.</b></font>

254
00:18:14.126 --> 00:18:15.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Berisik sekali. Melanthios</b></font>

255
00:18:16.126 --> 00:18:20.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lepas tajimu di istana.
Kau gembala. bukan ksatria.</b></font>

256
00:18:20.292 --> 00:18:23.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau itu peternak babi!
Atas dasar apa menasihatiku?</b></font>

257
00:18:24.042 --> 00:18:27.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tuan kita menunjukku
memimpin para gembala hewannya</b></font>

258
00:18:28.126 --> 00:18:31.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kita sudah lama tanpa tuan.
dasar tua bangka buta!</b></font>

259
00:18:32.042 --> 00:18:34.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan kau sama hinanya 
di sini bagai anjing ini.</b></font>

260
00:18:36.126 --> 00:18:36.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Argos!</b></font>

261
00:18:41.037 --> 00:18:42.290
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Argos!</b></font>

262
00:18:43.557 --> 00:18:45.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Argos!</b></font>

263
00:18:47.459 --> 00:18:49.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tuanku. dia tak berbuat apa-apa.</b></font>

264
00:18:49.376 --> 00:18:50.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jadi kau yang bau busuk ini?</b></font>

265
00:18:52.126 --> 00:18:53.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lepaskan anjing tua itu.</b></font>

266
00:18:53.959 --> 00:18:55.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Yang mana?
- Keduanya.</b></font>

267
00:18:56.709 --> 00:18:57.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau menghinaku?</b></font>

268
00:18:57.876 --> 00:19:00.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia berniat membela anjing
pemburu milik ayahku.</b></font>

269
00:19:00.709 --> 00:19:01.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Anjing pemburu?</b></font>

270
00:19:05.959 --> 00:19:07.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lihatlah rongsokan ini.</b></font>

271
00:19:08.376 --> 00:19:09.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Buang dia. Kita mau makan.</b></font>

272
00:19:09.876 --> 00:19:11.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tak lihatkah dia kesakitan?</b></font>

273
00:19:11.839 --> 00:19:12.934
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Baiklah</b></font>

274
00:19:12.959 --> 00:19:14.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Biar aku yang habisi.</b></font>

275
00:19:14.209 --> 00:19:15.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lepaskan dia!</b></font>

276
00:19:32.876 --> 00:19:33.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kalian lihat?</b></font>

277
00:19:35.126 --> 00:19:36.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kalian semua lihat?</b></font>

278
00:19:37.542 --> 00:19:40.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia menyerangku! 
Hakku untuk membela diri!</b></font>

279
00:19:40.876 --> 00:19:41.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kumohon!</b></font>

280
00:19:44.376 --> 00:19:46.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jangan sakiti putraku.</b></font>

281
00:19:49.042 --> 00:19:50.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tenanglah. Polybus.</b></font>

282
00:19:51.459 --> 00:19:53.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bocah ingusan ini cuma emosi. 
berbaik hatilah.</b></font>

283
00:19:56.042 --> 00:19:58.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lanjut minum anggurnya. 
biar kuurus ini.</b></font>

284
00:19:59.042 --> 00:20:00.750
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ini anjing pemburu milik ayahku.</b></font>

285
00:20:01.959 --> 00:20:04.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia bertahan hidup 
cuma untuk melihat Odisseus pulang.</b></font>

286
00:20:04.959 --> 00:20:08.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ku buang dia ke tumpukan pupuk di luar.
biar dia lekas melihatnya.</b></font>

287
00:20:18.542 --> 00:20:20.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Anjing itu tetap di luar!</b></font>

288
00:20:22.034 --> 00:20:24.794
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Berpikirlah sebelum 
berkorban demi hewan.</b></font>

289
00:20:36.042 --> 00:20:37.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Eurycleia.</b></font>

290
00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:41.546
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kirim logistik makanan ke kapal
jangan bilang siapapun</b></font>

291
00:20:41.876 --> 00:20:42.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dikawal orang terpercaya.</b></font>

292
00:20:43.209 --> 00:20:44.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Itu akan menghancurkan ibumu.</b></font>

293
00:20:44.792 --> 00:20:48.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan tak ada yang akan 
membelaku.</b></font>

294
00:20:48.376 --> 00:20:50.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku butuh kabar soal ayahku.</b></font>

295
00:20:50.149 --> 00:20:53.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ithaca akan mendukungku jika Odisseus
memang sudah mati.</b></font>

296
00:20:53.792 --> 00:20:56.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Para pelamar akan murka.
kau takkan bisa pulang!</b></font>

297
00:20:56.876 --> 00:20:59.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Suruh Mentor menemuiku
di kapal sebelum fajar.</b></font>

298
00:21:00.126 --> 00:21:02.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa yang harus kukatakan 
pada ibumu?</b></font>

299
00:21:03.792 --> 00:21:05.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bertahanlah semampunya.</b></font>

300
00:21:08.959 --> 00:21:11.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kapal sudah siap. 
ombaknya bersahabat.</b></font>

301
00:21:11.709 --> 00:21:15.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sudah kubilang matamu bijak.
layaknya mata Athena?</b></font>

302
00:21:15.459 --> 00:21:16.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>1 atau 2 kali</b></font>

303
00:21:16.792 --> 00:21:18.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau tak tanya ke mana kita pergi?</b></font>

304
00:21:18.792 --> 00:21:21.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Ke mana kita?
- Mencari ayahku.</b></font>

305
00:21:21.459 --> 00:21:24.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia masih hidup. 
angin dan ombak mengatakannya.</b></font>

306
00:21:24.376 --> 00:21:27.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia tersesat entah di mana. 
luka-luka. siapa tahu?</b></font>

307
00:21:29.042 --> 00:21:30.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Namun beliau masih hidup.</b></font>

308
00:22:00.959 --> 00:22:02.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mimpi lagi?</b></font>

309
00:22:03.459 --> 00:22:04.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pria-pria yang tenggelam.</b></font>

310
00:22:05.615 --> 00:22:08.399
<font color="#fff22f"><b>di dalam suatu</b></font>

311
00:22:09.542 --> 00:22:10.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>tempat yang gelap.</b></font>

312
00:22:13.209 --> 00:22:16.053
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Cahaya api pada batu. 
Aku lupa</b></font>

313
00:22:18.376 --> 00:22:19.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sengaja?</b></font>

314
00:22:19.959 --> 00:22:23.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kenapa titah para dewa
tak bisa dipahami?</b></font>

315
00:22:25.376 --> 00:22:27.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Siapa yang tak paham guntur?</b></font>

316
00:22:27.868 --> 00:22:28.995
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Atau api?</b></font>

317
00:22:29.682 --> 00:22:32.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Senyum bocah. 
atau panen melimpah?</b></font>

318
00:22:32.626 --> 00:22:34.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kalian sembunyi dari kami.</b></font>

319
00:22:36.376 --> 00:22:37.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lihatlah.</b></font>

320
00:22:38.459 --> 00:22:40.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Siapa yang menggerakkan awan ini?</b></font>

321
00:22:40.876 --> 00:22:42.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Siapa yang mengumpulkan kawanan burung ini?</b></font>

322
00:22:43.959 --> 00:22:45.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Siapa yang mengaduk perairan?</b></font>

323
00:22:47.542 --> 00:22:49.018
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau bicara dengan siapa?</b></font>

324
00:22:51.876 --> 00:22:53.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Athena hadir lagi di hadapanku.</b></font>

325
00:22:54.126 --> 00:22:56.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia menyuruhku mengingat.</b></font>

326
00:22:57.876 --> 00:23:00.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Untuk pergi.
- Mengapa kau mau pergi?</b></font>

327
00:23:00.792 --> 00:23:02.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kita punya segalanya.</b></font>

328
00:23:03.459 --> 00:23:05.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sudah berapa lama 
aku di sini. Calypso?</b></font>

329
00:23:10.126 --> 00:23:12.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku punya rumah. entah di mana</b></font>

330
00:23:14.126 --> 00:23:15.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ada orang yang menungguku</b></font>

331
00:23:15.792 --> 00:23:17.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>di luasnya dunia.</b></font>

332
00:23:17.542 --> 00:23:18.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tahu apa kau?</b></font>

333
00:23:19.376 --> 00:23:20.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku tak tahu apa-apa.</b></font>

334
00:23:23.209 --> 00:23:24.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku merasakannya.</b></font>

335
00:23:40.953 --> 00:23:43.160
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hidup ini bisa menjadi kekal</b></font>

336
00:23:43.249 --> 00:23:44.642
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Itu hanya untuk para dewa.</b></font>

337
00:23:44.667 --> 00:23:46.340
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa kau seorang dewi?</b></font>

338
00:23:48.877 --> 00:23:52.746
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau ingin mengingat.
