721
01:18:27.318 --> 01:18:28.591
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kembalilah.</b></font>

722
01:18:32.542 --> 01:18:33.641
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Odisseus.</b></font>

723
01:18:34.209 --> 01:18:37.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kita kembali ke kapal. 
penuhi logistik.</b></font>

724
01:18:37.959 --> 01:18:39.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tinggalkan dagingnya.</b></font>

725
01:18:39.459 --> 01:18:41.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jangan biarkan penyihir ini hidup.</b></font>

726
01:18:42.292 --> 01:18:45.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Siapa yang memberi dia kesaktian?
Dewamu.</b></font>

727
01:18:45.233 --> 01:18:47.267
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Isikan guci dan wadah air
disungai.</b></font>

728
01:18:47.292 --> 01:18:49.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kita berlayar saat fajar.</b></font>

729
01:18:54.709 --> 01:18:56.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mengapa membiarkannya begitu saja?</b></font>

730
01:18:56.876 --> 01:18:58.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kami lebih cocok begini.</b></font>

731
01:19:00.126 --> 01:19:02.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Maaf jika kami menyinggungmu.</b></font>

732
01:19:03.459 --> 01:19:05.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bantu kami pulang.</b></font>

733
01:19:05.709 --> 01:19:07.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>temukan kembali jalur dagang.</b></font>

734
01:19:07.709 --> 01:19:09.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kalian terlanjur tersesat jauh.</b></font>

735
01:19:09.542 --> 01:19:10.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa maksudmu?</b></font>

736
01:19:12.244 --> 01:19:14.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Cuma Tiresias buta
 yang tahu jalannya.</b></font>

737
01:19:15.209 --> 01:19:17.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Tiresias? 
- Di alam Hades.</b></font>

738
01:19:18.042 --> 01:19:21.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tiada yang mengarungi neraka 
lalu kembali.</b></font>

739
01:19:21.376 --> 01:19:22.391
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau pasti bisa.</b></font>

740
01:19:23.792 --> 01:19:25.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Berlayarlah ke utara. 
menuju senja.</b></font>

741
01:19:31.959 --> 01:19:35.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lalu masuklah ke daratan
 tempat sungai api</b></font>

742
01:19:35.459 --> 01:19:37.000
<font color="#fff22f"><b>bertemu dengan sungai es</b></font>

743
01:20:28.792 --> 01:20:30.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di sana. galilah parit.</b></font>

744
01:20:33.626 --> 01:20:35.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>tumpahkan darah hewan kurban
 ke dalamnya...</b></font>

745
01:20:55.376 --> 01:20:56.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>panggillah arwah orang mati</b></font>

746
01:20:57.709 --> 01:20:59.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan pelajari cara untuk pulang.</b></font>

747
01:21:01.459 --> 01:21:02.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau.</b></font>

748
01:21:03.709 --> 01:21:05.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>bukan pasukanmu.</b></font>

749
01:21:05.626 --> 01:21:06.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau mengutuk mereka</b></font>

750
01:21:07.292 --> 01:21:08.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bukan kutukan</b></font>

751
01:21:09.542 --> 01:21:10.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>sebuah kenyataan</b></font>

752
01:21:11.626 --> 01:21:14.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>bahwa kau menantang 
para dewa.</b></font>

753
01:21:15.709 --> 01:21:17.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>hanya kau 
yang akan pulang.</b></font>

754
01:21:19.111 --> 01:21:20.970
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Maka. kutantang para dewa</b></font>

755
01:22:00.651 --> 01:22:01.751
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sinon.</b></font>

756
01:22:02.292 --> 01:22:03.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>ini Odisseus.</b></font>

757
01:22:07.876 --> 01:22:08.974
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sinon.</b></font>

758
01:22:10.042 --> 01:22:11.058
<font color="#fff22f"><b>ini Odisseus.</b></font>

759
01:22:13.626 --> 01:22:15.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Biarkan dia minum. Odisseus.</b></font>

760
01:22:16.126 --> 01:22:17.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan kau akan mendengar kesaksiannya.</b></font>

761
01:22:31.792 --> 01:22:32.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Odisseus?</b></font>

762
01:22:33.234 --> 01:22:34.420
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ya</b></font>

763
01:22:34.626 --> 01:22:36.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau telah membohongi semua orang.</b></font>

764
01:22:39.792 --> 01:22:41.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Haruskah kau membohongiku juga?</b></font>

765
01:22:42.709 --> 01:22:44.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau memang harus mempercayainya.</b></font>

766
01:22:46.209 --> 01:22:48.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mengapa kau menjadi relawan?</b></font>

767
01:22:48.376 --> 01:22:49.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau tidak ingat lagi?</b></font>

768
01:22:49.959 --> 01:22:52.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku memohon untuk 
menggantikan Antinous</b></font>

769
01:22:53.292 --> 01:22:54.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>saat dia direkrut</b></font>

770
01:22:55.042 --> 01:22:58.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia membayar keluargamu
agar kau menggantikannya.</b></font>

771
01:22:58.709 --> 01:23:00.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jika bangsa Troya tidak mengampuniku.</b></font>

772
01:23:03.126 --> 01:23:04.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>jika aku tidak pulang.</b></font>

773
01:23:04.959 --> 01:23:06.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>sampaikan ini kepada ayahku.</b></font>

774
01:23:07.876 --> 01:23:09.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ceritakan padanya semua perbuatanku.</b></font>

775
01:23:12.376 --> 01:23:13.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Odisseus?</b></font>

776
01:23:15.542 --> 01:23:17.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jangan ragu menambahkan ceritanya.</b></font>

777
01:23:21.209 --> 01:23:23.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau tidak menceritakan kebenaran padaku?</b></font>

778
01:23:25.292 --> 01:23:27.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku rela mati demi dirimu!</b></font>

779
01:23:27.542 --> 01:23:30.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Saat ajal. kebenaran terucap.
Kau harus percaya.</b></font>

780
01:23:30.733 --> 01:23:33.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku mati demi dustamu.</b></font>

781
01:23:34.126 --> 01:23:36.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku tahu. aku bersamamu saat itu.</b></font>

782
01:23:36.709 --> 01:23:39.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kudengar kau membisikkan 
dusta itu saat sekarat</b></font>

783
01:23:39.792 --> 01:23:41.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>yang memenangkan perang ini.</b></font>

784
01:23:42.126 --> 01:23:44.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku sedekat itu 
hingga merasakan darahmu</b></font>

785
01:23:44.459 --> 01:23:46.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Penghiburan apa yang kudapat</b></font>

786
01:23:47.876 --> 01:23:51.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>jika aku baru tahu kau di dalam kuda itu
dari arwah?</b></font>

787
01:23:53.126 --> 01:23:54.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Arwah mana?</b></font>

788
01:23:54.626 --> 01:23:58.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Banyak veteran perangmu 
gentayangan di sini.</b></font>

789
01:24:00.292 --> 01:24:03.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kaum mati berkumpul 
meratapi yang hidup</b></font>

790
01:24:03.542 --> 01:24:05.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan menyambut arwah baru.</b></font>

791
01:24:06.376 --> 01:24:08.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Arwah ayahku menemukanku</b></font>

792
01:24:09.042 --> 01:24:12.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Untuk menghiburmu?
- Arwah tidak menghibur.</b></font>

793
01:24:12.792 --> 01:24:16.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mereka mencari tahu 
perusak hidup mereka</b></font>

794
01:24:16.959 --> 01:24:19.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ayahku wafat dalam kemiskinan.</b></font>

795
01:24:19.876 --> 01:24:20.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>sebatang kara.</b></font>

796
01:24:21.209 --> 01:24:24.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>mengemis sisa makanan
pada orang sekelas Antinous.</b></font>

797
01:24:24.876 --> 01:24:26.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Antinous mengelabui kalian?</b></font>

798
01:24:27.202 --> 01:24:29.367
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dan dia akan lakukan hal sama padamu.</b></font>

799
01:24:29.542 --> 01:24:32.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Bagaimana?
- Siapa yang melindungi istri dan putramu?</b></font>

800
01:24:33.459 --> 01:24:35.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku tidak cemas soal istriku</b></font>

801
01:24:36.709 --> 01:24:39.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tanyai Agamemnon 
soal kepulangannya.</b></font>

802
01:24:40.042 --> 01:24:41.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Agamemnon ada di sini?</b></font>

803
01:24:44.959 --> 01:24:47.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau memakamkanku dengan layak di Troya.</b></font>

804
01:24:47.376 --> 01:24:48.474
<font color="#fff22f"><b>terima kasih.</b></font>

805
01:24:49.292 --> 01:24:51.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>namun kau telantarkan yang lain.</b></font>

806
01:24:51.709 --> 01:24:53.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku lakukan semampuku</b></font>

807
01:24:54.292 --> 01:24:55.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Saat kau pulang.</b></font>

808
01:24:56.459 --> 01:24:57.558
<font color="#fff22f"><b>naikilah kapal.</b></font>

809
01:24:57.792 --> 01:25:00.667
<font color="#fff22f"><b>berlayarlah ke barat 
 hingga mendarat</b></font>

810
01:25:01.000 --> 01:25:02.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di sana. berikan kurban</b></font>

811
01:25:03.376 --> 01:25:05.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan hormati pasukanmu.</b></font>

812
01:25:07.209 --> 01:25:08.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau masih membawa undian itu?</b></font>

813
01:25:12.376 --> 01:25:13.474
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tentu saja</b></font>

814
01:25:14.042 --> 01:25:15.141
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jika kau pulang.</b></font>

815
01:25:15.292 --> 01:25:17.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>balaslah kehinaannya.</b></font>

816
01:25:17.709 --> 01:25:18.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Percayakan padaku.</b></font>

817
01:25:30.209 --> 01:25:31.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Rajaku.</b></font>

818
01:25:43.126 --> 01:25:44.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Odisseus</b></font>

819
01:25:45.126 --> 01:25:46.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sedang apa kau di sini?</b></font>

820
01:25:47.126 --> 01:25:49.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pemenang. kau harusnya pulang.</b></font>

821
01:25:49.709 --> 01:25:50.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau. Odisseus.</b></font>

822
01:25:51.459 --> 01:25:56.669
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jenderal tercerdikku.
kau takkan terjebak sepertiku.</b></font>

823
01:25:56.694 --> 01:25:59.034
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apakah kau terombang-ambing seperti kami?</b></font>

824
01:25:59.251 --> 01:26:02.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tidak. Kemalanganku adalah pulang.</b></font>

825
01:26:03.876 --> 01:26:05.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>disambut istri cantikku...</b></font>

826
01:26:11.792 --> 01:26:12.891
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dibersihkan.</b></font>

827
01:26:15.459 --> 01:26:16.558
<font color="#fff22f"><b>diminyaki.</b></font>

828
01:26:19.126 --> 01:26:20.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dimanjakan...</b></font>

829
01:26:21.459 --> 01:26:23.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Untuk mempelajari pelajaran pahit</b></font>

830
01:26:24.155 --> 01:26:26.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>bahwa dulu aku telah meracuni hatinya</b></font>

831
01:26:29.459 --> 01:26:31.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>bahwa dia mencintai pria lain.</b></font>

832
01:26:37.459 --> 01:26:40.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia dan selingkuhannya merencanakan
pembunuhanku bertahun-tahun.</b></font>

833
01:26:41.792 --> 01:26:42.891
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Odisseus?</b></font>

834
01:26:44.164 --> 01:26:45.264
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ya</b></font>

835
01:26:45.542 --> 01:26:46.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Putraku. Orestes.</b></font>

836
01:26:47.459 --> 01:26:48.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>sudah membalaskan dendamku?</b></font>

837
01:26:49.042 --> 01:26:50.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bagaimana aku bisa tahu?</b></font>

838
01:26:51.459 --> 01:26:53.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku masih berusaha pulang.</b></font>

839
01:26:54.292 --> 01:26:56.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jangan ulangi kesalahanku.</b></font>

840
01:26:56.959 --> 01:27:00.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>jangan harap mahkota 
dan pujian saat pulang.</b></font>

841
01:27:00.876 --> 01:27:02.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pulanglah dengan menyamar.</b></font>

842
01:27:02.709 --> 01:27:03.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>cermatilah keadaan.</b></font>

843
01:27:04.709 --> 01:27:05.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>analisis.</b></font>

844
01:27:12.792 --> 01:27:14.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau paham?</b></font>

845
01:27:15.792 --> 01:27:18.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Aku tahu apa yang harus kulakukan.
- Baru sebagian.</b></font>

846
01:27:19.042 --> 01:27:21.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ramalanku bukan 
konsumsi mereka.</b></font>

847
01:27:22.709 --> 01:27:23.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kembalilah ke kapal.</b></font>

848
01:27:25.792 --> 01:27:26.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pergilah ke barat daya.</b></font>

849
01:27:27.042 --> 01:27:28.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>jauhi wilayah para Sirene.</b></font>

850
01:27:29.709 --> 01:27:32.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Nyanyian mereka memikat pasukanmu
hingga tewas</b></font>

851
01:27:33.126 --> 01:27:34.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku akan mencegah hal itu.</b></font>

852
01:27:35.126 --> 01:27:37.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>ku sumbat telinga mereka 
dengan lilin.</b></font>

853
01:27:37.459 --> 01:27:38.558
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Setelah para Sirene.</b></font>

854
01:27:38.702 --> 01:27:42.677
<font color="#fff22f"><b>kau harus memilih pusaran Kharybdis
atau monster Skila.</b></font>

855
01:27:42.709 --> 01:27:45.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pusaran laut akan menewaskan semua orang.</b></font>

856
01:27:45.292 --> 01:27:47.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>monster tebing 
cuma memangsa 6 orang.</b></font>

857
01:27:47.626 --> 01:27:51.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Namun ambisimu untuk menyelamatkan semua
justru menewaskan semuanya.</b></font>

858
01:27:52.817 --> 01:27:53.891
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku terpaksa merelakannya.</b></font>

859
01:27:53.959 --> 01:27:56.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Akhirnya. saat kelaparan 
dan makar mengancam</b></font>

860
01:27:56.792 --> 01:28:00.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>mereka menuntut berlabuh di tempat
ternak dewa matahari berada</b></font>

861
01:28:00.959 --> 01:28:03.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan menyembelih kawanan ternak Apollo.</b></font>

862
01:28:03.876 --> 01:28:05.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Zeus akan menghukum mati mereka.</b></font>

863
01:28:05.709 --> 01:28:06.724
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau paham?</b></font>

864
01:28:07.876 --> 01:28:09.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku akan mencegah mereka.</b></font>

865
01:28:09.292 --> 01:28:12.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mengapa kau begitu meratapi nyawa mereka
dibanding yang tewas?</b></font>

866
01:28:12.542 --> 01:28:14.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku masih bisa 
melindungi mereka dari dewa.</b></font>

867
01:28:15.709 --> 01:28:17.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Namun tidak dari kebodohan mereka sendiri.</b></font>

868
01:28:19.959 --> 01:28:21.058
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa itu?</b></font>

869
01:28:21.126 --> 01:28:22.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pasukanmu yang tak dimakamkan.</b></font>

870
01:28:25.959 --> 01:28:28.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mereka menuntutmu 
menanggung aib mereka.</b></font>

871
01:28:30.126 --> 01:28:31.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Cepat!</b></font>

872
01:29:14.959 --> 01:29:16.228
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Inikah takdir kita?</b></font>

873
01:29:18.815 --> 01:29:20.315
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Inikah takdir kita?</b></font>

874
01:29:40.626 --> 01:29:42.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kita kabur dari alam kubur.</b></font>

875
01:29:43.876 --> 01:29:46.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>menelantarkan banyak kawan di sana</b></font>

876
01:29:47.042 --> 01:29:48.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku wajib menyelamatkan sisa pasukan.</b></font>

877
01:29:49.542 --> 01:29:51.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa yang terjadi pada mereka?</b></font>

878
01:29:51.459 --> 01:29:52.724
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mereka meninggalkanku di sini?</b></font>

879
01:29:53.126 --> 01:29:54.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mereka akan kembali?</b></font>

880
01:29:56.542 --> 01:29:58.228
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau mencelakai mereka?</b></font>

881
01:29:59.829 --> 01:30:01.595
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau mencelakai mereka?</b></font>

882
01:30:01.626 --> 01:30:02.724
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Makanlah.</b></font>

883
01:30:02.876 --> 01:30:04.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau menyuruhku menyetop bunga teratai.</b></font>

884
01:30:05.209 --> 01:30:08.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Malam ini saja. 
agar kau bisa tidur sejenak.</b></font>

885
01:30:11.851 --> 01:30:15.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dan esok saat siap. 
kau akan mengingatnya.</b></font>

886
01:30:18.042 --> 01:30:19.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau akan akan ingat awak kapalmu.</b></font>

887
01:30:20.459 --> 01:30:21.558
<font color="#fff22f"><b>keluargamu</b></font>

888
01:30:21.753 --> 01:30:22.812
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Keluarga?</b></font>

889
01:30:24.528 --> 01:30:25.577
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Seorang istri?</b></font>

890
01:30:27.542 --> 01:30:28.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku punya istri</b></font>

891
01:30:34.355 --> 01:30:36.058
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jangan takut. Melantho!</b></font>

892
01:30:36.459 --> 01:30:37.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Orang asing dilarang masuk.</b></font>

893
01:30:37.959 --> 01:30:39.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Walau terhalang tirai ini.</b></font>

894
01:30:39.376 --> 01:30:42.566
<font color="#fff22f"><b>setelah 3 tahun. aku bukan lagi
orang asing bagimu.</b></font>

895
01:30:42.792 --> 01:30:46.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau berniat menikahiku 
atau merusak namaku?</b></font>

896
01:30:46.292 --> 01:30:47.658
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Melantho bisa menjaga rahasia.</b></font>

897
01:30:48.209 --> 01:30:51.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku ke sini justru karena 
peduli pada namamu.</b></font>

898
01:30:53.110 --> 01:30:54.934
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kami semua melihatmu bekerja keras.</b></font>

899
01:30:54.959 --> 01:30:57.429
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pekerjaanku merambat lambat tapi pasti.</b></font>

900
01:30:58.959 --> 01:31:01.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Namun tiap malam 
kau merajut ulang tenunanmu.</b></font>

901
01:31:07.542 --> 01:31:08.574
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tinggalkan kami.</b></font>

902
01:31:10.292 --> 01:31:14.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau tak bisa menganggapnya setia pada tuan
yang tak ia kenal.</b></font>

903
01:31:14.376 --> 01:31:16.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ku kira dia setia kepadaku.</b></font>

904
01:31:16.376 --> 01:31:19.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia akan setia 
saat kau menikahiku.</b></font>

905
01:31:20.126 --> 01:31:21.224
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Para budak</b></font>

906
01:31:21.376 --> 01:31:23.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>harus menaruh kesetiaan mereka
pada masa depan</b></font>

907
01:31:24.231 --> 01:31:26.471
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan rumah ini membutuhkan seorang tuan.</b></font>

908
01:31:26.626 --> 01:31:29.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>seperti halnya Ithaca mencari seorang raja.</b></font>

909
01:31:31.542 --> 01:31:33.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Raja Ithaca pasti akan kembali.</b></font>

910
01:31:33.959 --> 01:31:35.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mustahil.</b></font>

911
01:31:36.792 --> 01:31:39.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tahukah kau masa kecilku 
ingin ikut ke Troya?</b></font>

912
01:31:41.027 --> 01:31:42.787
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia tak menceritakannya padaku</b></font>

913
01:31:43.984 --> 01:31:45.378
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Odisseus menolak.</b></font>

914
01:31:45.542 --> 01:31:49.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau layak 
punya masa depan tanpanya.</b></font>

915
01:31:55.959 --> 01:31:58.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dan dia melihatku
bagian dari masa depan itu.</b></font>

916
01:32:02.959 --> 01:32:06.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku tak pernah cerita
kepada pelamar lainnya</b></font>

917
01:32:07.126 --> 01:32:08.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>tipu muslihatmu.</b></font>

918
01:32:10.792 --> 01:32:12.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Rampungkan tenunanmu.</b></font>

919
01:32:14.459 --> 01:32:16.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Saatnya mengucapkan 
selamat tinggal padanya.</b></font>

920
01:32:25.709 --> 01:32:28.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mengapa kau mau menikahi wanita
yang mencintai pria lain?</b></font>

921
01:32:31.542 --> 01:32:34.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kesetiaanmu pada Odisseus</b></font>

922
01:32:34.376 --> 01:32:36.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>kelebihan terbesarmu.</b></font>

923
01:32:39.876 --> 01:32:41.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku mencintaimu.</b></font>

924
01:32:41.959 --> 01:32:45.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pilihlah aku 
dan hentikan sandiwara ini.</b></font>

925
01:32:46.876 --> 01:32:49.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jangan katakan kau 
tidak lelah</b></font>

926
01:32:50.376 --> 01:32:53.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>menanti ketidakpastian ini.</b></font>

927
01:32:55.376 --> 01:32:58.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau sudah menunaikan tugasmu</b></font>

928
01:32:59.126 --> 01:33:01.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>tahun demi tahun.</b></font>

929
01:33:01.626 --> 01:33:03.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>berganti tahun.</b></font>

930
01:33:05.959 --> 01:33:07.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kini saatnya memikirkan dirimu.</b></font>

931
01:33:09.459 --> 01:33:11.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>mulailah hidup baru</b></font>

932
01:33:16.709 --> 01:33:18.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ini yang pasti Odisseus inginkan.</b></font>

933
01:33:25.626 --> 01:33:26.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku akan merawatmu.</b></font>

934
01:33:31.959 --> 01:33:33.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ratuku.</b></font>

935
01:33:36.376 --> 01:33:37.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lalu bagaimana dengan putraku?</b></font>

936
01:33:39.209 --> 01:33:41.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Takhta tetap miliknya. 
Dia sang pewaris</b></font>

937
01:33:44.904 --> 01:33:46.990
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kecuali jika kita punya anak.</b></font>

938
01:33:57.209 --> 01:33:58.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di mana Telemakus?</b></font>

939
01:34:00.209 --> 01:34:01.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di pedalaman.</b></font>

940
01:34:01.709 --> 01:34:03.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>menemui kakeknya.</b></font>

941
01:34:11.209 --> 01:34:12.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia bohong.</b></font>

942
01:34:12.709 --> 01:34:14.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dia pergi berlayar.</b></font>

943
01:34:28.126 --> 01:34:29.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia mencari jejak ayahnya.</b></font>

944
01:34:30.415 --> 01:34:31.484
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ke mana?</b></font>

945
01:34:31.542 --> 01:34:32.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ke Sparta.</b></font>

946
01:34:32.792 --> 01:34:34.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>menemui Menelaus</b></font>

947
01:34:35.292 --> 01:34:36.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kita harus ke sana</b></font>

948
01:34:37.779 --> 01:34:38.872
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tidak.</b></font>

949
01:34:39.959 --> 01:34:43.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Selalu saja berisik 
untuk seorang gembala!</b></font>

950
01:34:44.209 --> 01:34:45.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia menguping!</b></font>

951
01:34:45.413 --> 01:34:47.013
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tidak. Jangan!</b></font>

952
01:34:48.792 --> 01:34:50.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku sedang mencari Argos.</b></font>

953
01:34:51.626 --> 01:34:54.184
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Biarkan dia di sana. 
Pulanglah ke peternakan.</b></font>

954
01:34:54.209 --> 01:34:56.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kami akan mengutus Melanthios
mengambil babi-babimu.</b></font>

955
01:34:57.209 --> 01:34:59.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau tak berguna lagi di istana. tua bangka.</b></font>

956
01:34:59.459 --> 01:35:01.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku patuh pada nyonyaku.</b></font>

957
01:35:03.709 --> 01:35:04.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa dia tahu namamu?</b></font>

958
01:35:06.356 --> 01:35:07.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pergilah!</b></font>

959
01:35:07.876 --> 01:35:11.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Telemakus pasti pulang 
lewat kuil Pylos.</b></font>

960
01:35:12.042 --> 01:35:13.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Cegat dia di sana 
bersama anak buahmu.</b></font>

961
01:35:14.058 --> 01:35:15.785
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dan kau tinggal untuk merayu sang ratu?</b></font>

962
01:35:16.042 --> 01:35:17.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mustahil.</b></font>

963
01:35:17.959 --> 01:35:19.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia harus mati di jalan.</b></font>

964
01:35:19.959 --> 01:35:21.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Iros punya rencana.</b></font>

965
01:35:22.112 --> 01:35:23.552
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Iros?</b></font>

966
01:35:25.459 --> 01:35:29.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku mau pasukannya menemui ajal
 diparit. leher tergorok</b></font>

967
01:35:29.292 --> 01:35:31.885
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Telemakus dan pasukannya 
akan bersiap menghadapi bandit</b></font>

968
01:35:31.910 --> 01:35:34.039
<font color="#fff22f"><b>yang menguasai jalan dari sisi
hingga ke pylos</b></font>

969
01:35:34.959 --> 01:35:38.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>namun jika. di kuil.
dari pendeta sebelum tiba...</b></font>

970
01:35:39.626 --> 01:35:42.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bawa potongan tubuh Telemakus 
sebagai bukti.</b></font>

971
01:35:43.209 --> 01:35:44.224
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hidungnya.</b></font>

972
01:35:44.792 --> 01:35:46.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau bisa mengenalinya cuma dari hidungnya?</b></font>

973
01:35:49.959 --> 01:35:51.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Telinganya juga.</b></font>

974
01:35:56.459 --> 01:35:57.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Siapa yang melatihmu?</b></font>

975
01:35:57.959 --> 01:35:59.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Peternak babi ayahku.</b></font>

976
01:35:59.626 --> 01:36:02.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Peternak babi?
- Dan pelayan setianya.</b></font>

977
01:36:02.876 --> 01:36:05.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Odisseus meninggalkan pelayan 
paling setianya?</b></font>

978
01:36:05.876 --> 01:36:07.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia selalu paling masuk akal.</b></font>

979
01:36:08.209 --> 01:36:10.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Agamemnon cuma mendengarkan dia.</b></font>

980
01:36:11.376 --> 01:36:12.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Harusnya dia lebih menyimak.</b></font>

981
01:36:13.209 --> 01:36:14.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa yang terjadi pada saudaramu?</b></font>

982
01:36:14.792 --> 01:36:15.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Istrinya mengkhianatinya.</b></font>

983
01:36:16.376 --> 01:36:17.474
<font color="#fff22f"><b>wanita itu membunuhnya.</b></font>

984
01:36:17.876 --> 01:36:18.891
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa tindakanmu?</b></font>

985
01:36:19.042 --> 01:36:20.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Putranya. Orestes. yang membunuh mereka.</b></font>

986
01:36:21.959 --> 01:36:23.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia membunuh ibunya?</b></font>

987
01:36:24.292 --> 01:36:25.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dia membalas dendam ayahnya.</b></font>

988
01:36:26.626 --> 01:36:27.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>namun jangan cemas.</b></font>

989
01:36:28.126 --> 01:36:30.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>ibumu tidak sama 
dengan Klitemnestra.</b></font>

990
01:36:30.626 --> 01:36:31.641
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mungkin.</b></font>

991
01:36:32.071 --> 01:36:35.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>tapi pelamar mendesak Tetua
untuk menikahkannya.</b></font>

992
01:36:35.876 --> 01:36:38.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Takhta kosong membawa
 petaka.</b></font>

993
01:36:38.542 --> 01:36:40.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau tahu rumor soal Bangsa Laut.</b></font>

994
01:36:41.292 --> 01:36:44.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Kalian diserang?
- Tidak. tapi bahaya mendekat.</b></font>

995
01:36:44.959 --> 01:36:45.974
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sparta bersiap.</b></font>

996
01:36:46.292 --> 01:36:47.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lalu Ithaca?</b></font>

997
01:36:47.876 --> 01:36:50.218
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Harus siap mengerahkan pasukan.</b></font>

998
01:36:50.459 --> 01:36:51.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Takhta wajib diisi.</b></font>

999
01:36:51.959 --> 01:36:54.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pertarungan 
ada di sana. Nak.</b></font>

1000
01:36:55.260 --> 01:36:56.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau kabur dari masalah</b></font>

1001
01:36:58.042 --> 01:37:00.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan membiarkan ibumu 
di ujung tanduk.</b></font>

1002
01:37:01.876 --> 01:37:03.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku membayar tentara bayaran</b></font>

1003
01:37:03.792 --> 01:37:05.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku pulang untuk membunuh para pelamar?</b></font>

1004
01:37:06.126 --> 01:37:08.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Membunuh tamu kaya dan berkuasa?</b></font>

1005
01:37:09.042 --> 01:37:10.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau akan diasingkan.</b></font>

1006
01:37:11.209 --> 01:37:12.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lalu harus apa?</b></font>

1007
01:37:12.542 --> 01:37:15.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Usir mereka tanpa melanggar 
hukum Zeus.</b></font>

1008
01:37:17.542 --> 01:37:19.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku harus merebut takhta</b></font>

1009
01:37:20.626 --> 01:37:22.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>tahu Odisseus hidup atau mati.</b></font>

1010
01:37:22.959 --> 01:37:26.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ini tak ada kaitannya 
dengan ayahmu.</b></font>

1011
01:37:26.643 --> 01:37:28.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau harus bertindak layaknya raja.</b></font>

1012
01:37:28.584 --> 01:37:30.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>di mana pun Odisseus berada.</b></font>

1013
01:37:45.042 --> 01:37:46.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau wajib ingat</b></font>

1014
01:37:46.542 --> 01:37:47.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tidak</b></font>

1015
01:37:48.626 --> 01:37:51.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Persetan dengan kebenaran.
