1183
01:53:46.126 --> 01:53:47.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tega nian dirimu?</b></font>

1184
01:53:47.542 --> 01:53:49.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Teratai mengaburkan ingatan</b></font>

1185
01:53:49.709 --> 01:53:53.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan melumpuhkan niat. 
tapi tak mengubah jatidiri.</b></font>

1186
01:53:53.626 --> 01:53:56.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau belum siap pulang 
tanpa alasan kuat</b></font>

1187
01:53:56.959 --> 01:53:58.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kini aku sudah siap</b></font>

1188
01:53:59.792 --> 01:54:01.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sesuai dugaanku.</b></font>

1189
01:54:02.459 --> 01:54:03.558
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bagaimana bisa?</b></font>

1190
01:54:03.626 --> 01:54:08.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau menggenggam erat sesuatu
di minggu-minggu pertama</b></font>

1191
01:54:09.209 --> 01:54:10.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan kau berseru.</b></font>

1192
01:54:11.209 --> 01:54:12.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Biasanya Athena.</b></font>

1193
01:54:12.511 --> 01:54:15.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>tapi kadang kau meneriakkan 
nama lain.</b></font>

1194
01:54:30.126 --> 01:54:31.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Penelope.</b></font>

1195
01:54:35.792 --> 01:54:37.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bantu aku pulang.</b></font>

1196
01:54:38.082 --> 01:54:39.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Itulah yang kulakukan</b></font>

1197
01:54:40.376 --> 01:54:43.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau sosok yang ingin 
mengendalikan takdirnya.</b></font>

1198
01:54:44.542 --> 01:54:46.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>namun takdir tak bisa dikendalikan</b></font>

1199
01:54:49.542 --> 01:54:51.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau harus pasrah pada badai.</b></font>

1200
01:54:52.459 --> 01:54:54.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>pasrah pada Poseidon</b></font>

1201
01:54:55.626 --> 01:54:57.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan menerima hukumanmu.</b></font>

1202
01:54:59.959 --> 01:55:01.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Zeus takkan membiarkan dia membunuhmu.</b></font>

1203
01:55:05.566 --> 01:55:09.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Berhentilah melawan.
ikhlaskan dan hiduplah.</b></font>

1204
01:55:11.792 --> 01:55:13.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Itu lompatan ke arah ketidakpastian</b></font>

1205
01:55:13.626 --> 01:55:16.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>yang belum berani kau ambil. Odisseus.</b></font>

1206
01:56:09.459 --> 01:56:10.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Odisseus</b></font>

1207
01:56:18.459 --> 01:56:19.558
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku di mana?</b></font>

1208
01:56:21.459 --> 01:56:23.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tak kenalkah tanah airmu sendiri?</b></font>

1209
01:57:00.792 --> 01:57:03.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Zeus menyambut kalian. wahai musafir</b></font>

1210
01:57:03.459 --> 01:57:04.474
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Berapa jumlah kalian?</b></font>

1211
01:57:05.042 --> 01:57:06.058
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Setengah lusin.</b></font>

1212
01:57:06.626 --> 01:57:07.724
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Butuh makanan?</b></font>

1213
01:57:07.792 --> 01:57:09.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dan perbekalan</b></font>

1214
01:57:09.626 --> 01:57:10.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>untuk di jalan.</b></font>

1215
01:57:11.126 --> 01:57:13.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Mau ke mana kalian? 
- Kami butuh babi.</b></font>

1216
01:57:13.626 --> 01:57:15.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kami mau ke Pylos.</b></font>

1217
01:57:15.542 --> 01:57:17.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kalian peziarah?</b></font>

1218
01:57:17.626 --> 01:57:18.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tampang kami mirip peziarah?</b></font>

1219
01:57:19.126 --> 01:57:20.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku tak bisa lihat jelas.</b></font>

1220
01:57:21.376 --> 01:57:24.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Zeus perintahkan menjamu.
tapi aku tak bisa menjual babi-babi ini.</b></font>

1221
01:57:25.209 --> 01:57:27.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tenang saja. kami takkan bayar.</b></font>

1222
01:57:31.300 --> 01:57:33.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sampaikan salamku pada ibumu</b></font>

1223
01:57:36.126 --> 01:57:37.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sampaikan rasa sesalku</b></font>

1224
01:57:37.792 --> 01:57:41.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>soal Troya dan semua hal
yang terjadi atas namaku.</b></font>

1225
01:57:47.619 --> 01:57:49.951
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Maaf tiada kabar baru 
soal ayahmu</b></font>

1226
01:57:49.983 --> 01:57:51.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau tahu hal baru</b></font>

1227
01:57:51.292 --> 01:57:53.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>soal sifat aslinya.</b></font>

1228
01:57:54.459 --> 01:57:56.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku makin penasaran
 ingin bertemu dengannya.</b></font>

1229
01:58:01.876 --> 01:58:03.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di mana anjing 
penjagamu. kek?</b></font>

1230
01:58:08.209 --> 01:58:10.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku membakar bangkai mereka</b></font>

1231
01:58:14.292 --> 01:58:16.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mungkinkah Zeus menolongmu. musafir?</b></font>

1232
01:58:17.459 --> 01:58:18.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ada yang menyerangmu?</b></font>

1233
01:58:19.376 --> 01:58:21.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Anjing itu menyelamatkan gembalamu?</b></font>

1234
01:58:21.473 --> 01:58:23.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tidak. kami bakar duluan teman-temannya.</b></font>

1235
01:58:26.292 --> 01:58:28.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa yang terjadi dengan Ithaca?</b></font>

1236
01:58:28.209 --> 01:58:29.224
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Masa kelam.</b></font>

1237
01:58:29.459 --> 01:58:32.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>hukum Zeus hancur berkeping-keping</b></font>

1238
01:58:32.709 --> 01:58:35.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>kerajaan tanpa raja sejak
kematian tuanku</b></font>

1239
01:58:35.959 --> 01:58:36.991
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tuanmu?</b></font>

1240
01:58:37.709 --> 01:58:39.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Odisseus</b></font>

1241
01:58:39.709 --> 01:58:41.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pahlawan Perang Troya</b></font>

1242
01:58:43.376 --> 01:58:44.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Namun Odisseus masih hidup</b></font>

1243
01:58:45.048 --> 01:58:47.179
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lagi-lagi pengemis menyebar
 harapan palsu</b></font>

1244
01:58:47.204 --> 01:58:51.846
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hentikan!</b></font>

1245
01:58:53.042 --> 01:58:54.057
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Telemakus...</b></font>

1246
01:58:54.418 --> 01:58:55.831
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Waktunya istirahat</b></font>

1247
01:58:55.970 --> 01:58:57.217
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Telemakus...</b></font>

1248
01:58:57.242 --> 01:59:00.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia dalam bahaya. 
aku tak bisa membantunya</b></font>

1249
01:59:00.209 --> 01:59:03.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Warga Ithaca lain pasti siap
membantu putra Odisseus.</b></font>

1250
01:59:03.876 --> 01:59:06.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Istana dikuasai para pelamar.</b></font>

1251
01:59:06.626 --> 01:59:09.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tiada yang tersisa setia pada Odisseus</b></font>

1252
01:59:10.209 --> 01:59:11.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lalu bagaimana dengan sang ratu?</b></font>

1253
01:59:12.236 --> 01:59:14.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Penelope yang jelita dan bijak</b></font>

1254
01:59:15.042 --> 01:59:17.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>disandera para penjahat</b></font>

1255
01:59:17.376 --> 01:59:19.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan tak lama lagi dipaksa menikah.</b></font>

1256
01:59:19.542 --> 01:59:22.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>apa dayanya. 
tanpa putranya?</b></font>

1257
01:59:22.709 --> 01:59:23.808
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Minumlah.</b></font>

1258
01:59:27.876 --> 01:59:29.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa yang mengancam Telemakus</b></font>

1259
01:59:30.209 --> 01:59:32.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia sedang dalam perjalanan
 pulang dari Sparta</b></font>

1260
01:59:33.459 --> 01:59:37.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Para pelamar mengutus pembunuh bayaran
menghabisinya di kuil Pylos.</b></font>

1261
01:59:38.626 --> 01:59:40.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Beri aku perbekalan untuk di jalan.</b></font>

1262
01:59:40.619 --> 01:59:43.201
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau takkan bisa menyusul pembunuh itu.</b></font>

1263
01:59:43.534 --> 01:59:46.821
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bila sampai Pylos sebelum Telemakus.
aku bisa peringatkan dia.</b></font>

1264
01:59:47.042 --> 01:59:48.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kenapa kau membantunya?</b></font>

1265
01:59:49.202 --> 01:59:51.036
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jangan marah dengan jawabanku.</b></font>

1266
01:59:51.626 --> 01:59:54.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Aku pernah memihak Odisseus. di Troya
- Benarkah?</b></font>

1267
01:59:55.709 --> 01:59:58.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Pemimpin yang keras.
- Namun dia adil.</b></font>

1268
01:59:59.626 --> 02:00:01.953
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Adil dan pantas jadi teladan.</b></font>

1269
02:00:02.876 --> 02:00:03.891
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau menyukainya?</b></font>

1270
02:00:04.876 --> 02:00:06.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Layaknya anak sendiri.</b></font>

1271
02:00:08.376 --> 02:00:09.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia belum mati.</b></font>

1272
02:00:10.792 --> 02:00:12.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia akan pulang?</b></font>

1273
02:00:12.792 --> 02:00:13.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Segera.</b></font>

1274
02:00:14.209 --> 02:00:16.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Untuk menuntaskan dendamnya.</b></font>

1275
02:00:18.292 --> 02:00:19.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Balas dendam paling kejam.</b></font>

1276
02:00:29.292 --> 02:00:32.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Biar aku yang bicara.
Jangan ungkap identitasmu.</b></font>

1277
02:00:32.323 --> 02:00:34.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Harusnya kita datang tanpa pengawal.</b></font>

1278
02:00:35.042 --> 02:00:37.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ini berguna andai
ada kendala di jalan.</b></font>

1279
02:00:50.542 --> 02:00:52.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ada pesan untukmu. Tunggu!</b></font>

1280
02:00:54.102 --> 02:00:55.329
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Eumaeus yang mengutusku!</b></font>

1281
02:00:57.376 --> 02:00:58.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bawa pengemis itu padaku.</b></font>

1282
02:01:15.714 --> 02:01:18.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kalian tunggu di sini. 
tinggalkan senjata</b></font>

1283
02:01:35.792 --> 02:01:37.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Zeus menyambut kalian. musafir</b></font>

1284
02:01:37.959 --> 02:01:39.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Perjalanan kalian jauh?</b></font>

1285
02:01:39.959 --> 02:01:41.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tidak juga.</b></font>

1286
02:01:42.376 --> 02:01:44.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kalian mau bermalam di sini?</b></font>

1287
02:01:46.292 --> 02:01:48.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kami ke sini untuk berkurban pada Athena.</b></font>

1288
02:01:51.126 --> 02:01:54.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Setiap tawaran ramah 
akan kami timbang.</b></font>

1289
02:01:54.209 --> 02:01:56.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bagus. 
Keluar kau. dasar pengemis!</b></font>

1290
02:01:56.626 --> 02:01:58.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia membawa pesan untukku.</b></font>

1291
02:01:59.376 --> 02:02:00.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Eumaeus mengutusmu?</b></font>

1292
02:02:01.876 --> 02:02:02.974
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ya. Tuanku.</b></font>

1293
02:02:09.042 --> 02:02:10.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pesan apa itu?</b></font>

1294
02:02:11.792 --> 02:02:13.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ini sangat rahasia.</b></font>

1295
02:02:13.376 --> 02:02:14.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Orang-orang ini</b></font>

1296
02:02:15.709 --> 02:02:16.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Orang-orang ini pendeta.</b></font>

1297
02:02:35.292 --> 02:02:37.632
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Enyahlah. pak tua.</b></font>

1298
02:02:38.126 --> 02:02:39.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pergilah. orang asing.</b></font>

1299
02:02:42.292 --> 02:02:44.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Minggu ini aku mengampuni 
nyawa pak tua.</b></font>

1300
02:02:45.042 --> 02:02:47.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>namun dia buta. 
Aku takkan mengampuni...</b></font>

1301
02:03:27.626 --> 02:03:29.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hebat juga untuk ukuran pengemis</b></font>

1302
02:03:29.626 --> 02:03:31.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tiada yang terlahir sebagai pengemis.</b></font>

1303
02:03:31.594 --> 02:03:34.534
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kenakan jubah pendeta ini 
di luar zirahmu.</b></font>

1304
02:03:36.542 --> 02:03:39.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Bantu aku membawanya
- Kita harus meninggalkannya</b></font>

1305
02:03:39.456 --> 02:03:41.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Tidak.
- Agar bisa lolos diam-diam</b></font>

1306
02:03:41.792 --> 02:03:44.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Tak lazim perlakukan jenazah begitu.
- Begitulah cara agar tetap hidup.</b></font>

1307
02:03:44.816 --> 02:03:46.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia guruku.</b></font>

1308
02:03:46.959 --> 02:03:49.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Bisa jadi dia titisan Athena.
- Namanya Mentor.</b></font>

1309
02:03:50.209 --> 02:03:54.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Saat kau lolos. kita ke barat 
untuk makamkannya.</b></font>

1310
02:03:55.042 --> 02:03:56.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mereka komplotan penjahat kiriman pelamar.</b></font>

1311
02:03:57.126 --> 02:03:59.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Yang lain kan menyusul. 
Ayo bergegas.</b></font>

1312
02:03:59.376 --> 02:04:01.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Malam ini?
- Ketimbang bertahan di sini.</b></font>

1313
02:04:01.709 --> 02:04:03.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mentor terbujur 
di kuil kuno Athena.</b></font>

1314
02:04:04.626 --> 02:04:06.826
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Untuk sementara. kita hormati lewat kremasi</b></font>

1315
02:04:16.209 --> 02:04:17.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kebakaran!</b></font>

1316
02:04:44.042 --> 02:04:45.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau. pengemis. 
kau kenal Mentor?</b></font>

1317
02:04:46.042 --> 02:04:48.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sudah kubilang. 
aku tak terlahir menjadi pengemis.</b></font>

1318
02:04:48.792 --> 02:04:51.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Matamu bijak nian.
seolah titisan Athena.</b></font>

1319
02:04:51.626 --> 02:04:54.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jangan samakan manusia dengan dewa.
kau akan kecewa</b></font>

1320
02:04:55.042 --> 02:04:56.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jadi. katakan padaku siapa dirimu</b></font>

1321
02:04:58.292 --> 02:04:59.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Namaku Sinon.</b></font>

1322
02:05:00.209 --> 02:05:03.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku veteran perang.
pengikut ayahmu bertarung di Troya.</b></font>

1323
02:05:04.209 --> 02:05:05.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau kenal ayahku?</b></font>

1324
02:05:05.709 --> 02:05:09.055
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku mematuhinya 
sejak dulu kala</b></font>

1325
02:05:09.709 --> 02:05:11.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jadi. dia masih hidup?</b></font>

1326
02:05:11.959 --> 02:05:13.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ya. masih.</b></font>

1327
02:05:14.376 --> 02:05:15.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Namun di mana dia?</b></font>

1328
02:05:15.959 --> 02:05:17.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia dekat dari sini</b></font>

1329
02:05:17.959 --> 02:05:20.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan mengutusku untuk 
memantau keadaan.</b></font>

1330
02:05:21.459 --> 02:05:24.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Ibu takkan percaya ini!
- Jangan beritahu dia.</b></font>

1331
02:05:25.626 --> 02:05:26.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Diam saja?</b></font>

1332
02:05:27.792 --> 02:05:28.891
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Katakan padanya</b></font>

1333
02:05:29.959 --> 02:05:32.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>kau memutuskan agar dia 
menikah lagi.</b></font>

1334
02:05:33.959 --> 02:05:36.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ayah mengujinya. dia tak percaya pada ibu?</b></font>

1335
02:05:36.376 --> 02:05:37.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bukan.</b></font>

1336
02:05:37.876 --> 02:05:40.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>tapi ibumu punya alasan kuat 
untuk melupakannya.</b></font>

1337
02:05:41.959 --> 02:05:43.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa ada pelayan yang masih setia?</b></font>

1338
02:05:44.459 --> 02:05:45.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Beberapa orang.</b></font>

1339
02:05:46.376 --> 02:05:49.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Saat ayahmu muncul. 
semua akan setia.</b></font>

1340
02:05:50.042 --> 02:05:52.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Harus mengumpulkan pelamar 
di istana.</b></font>

1341
02:05:53.126 --> 02:05:54.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Itu bukan masalah.</b></font>

1342
02:05:55.209 --> 02:05:57.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau membawa hadiah dari Menelaus?</b></font>

1343
02:05:57.292 --> 02:05:58.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ya. di kapalku</b></font>

1344
02:05:58.959 --> 02:05:59.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bagus.</b></font>

1345
02:06:00.459 --> 02:06:01.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pulanglah layaknya pangeran.</b></font>

1346
02:06:02.126 --> 02:06:03.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>perintahkan perjamuan.</b></font>

1347
02:06:03.959 --> 02:06:05.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku akan hadir.</b></font>

1348
02:06:06.126 --> 02:06:07.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa yang akan kau lakukan?</b></font>

1349
02:06:08.376 --> 02:06:09.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku akan mengemis.</b></font>

1350
02:06:09.959 --> 02:06:12.537
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Keadaan lebih jelas 
dari bawah sini.</b></font>

1351
02:06:14.209 --> 02:06:16.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Berapa jumlah pelamar?</b></font>

1352
02:06:16.459 --> 02:06:17.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Puluhan.</b></font>

1353
02:06:18.042 --> 02:06:21.696
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Meski anak buahnya mampu mengimbangimu.
- Tak satupun.</b></font>

1354
02:06:22.385 --> 02:06:23.758
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa hanya dirimu?</b></font>

1355
02:06:24.762 --> 02:06:26.108
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dan kamu.</b></font>

1356
02:06:31.746 --> 02:06:33.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Telemakus pulang!
- Apa?</b></font>

1357
02:06:33.709 --> 02:06:35.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Telemakus pulang!</b></font>

1358
02:06:35.924 --> 02:06:38.557
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Kata siapa?
- Semua orang!</b></font>

1359
02:06:38.792 --> 02:06:39.808
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di mana Telemakus?</b></font>

1360
02:06:40.792 --> 02:06:43.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ratuku. sebaiknya kau tetap 
di atas!</b></font>

1361
02:06:51.876 --> 02:06:53.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Benarkah itu?</b></font>

1362
02:06:56.126 --> 02:06:57.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau sudah kembali!</b></font>

1363
02:06:58.209 --> 02:06:59.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ini aku.</b></font>

1364
02:06:59.876 --> 02:07:01.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>mari kita rayakan malam ini.</b></font>

1365
02:07:02.459 --> 02:07:05.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jika masih ada remah makanan yang tersisa
utuk perayaan apa pun.</b></font>

1366
02:07:07.285 --> 02:07:11.873
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tenang. pelamar akan memanjakan kita 
di perayaan kepulanganmu.</b></font>

1367
02:07:11.959 --> 02:07:13.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Senang kau pulang dengan selamat.</b></font>

1368
02:07:25.214 --> 02:07:27.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Senang kau sudah pulih.</b></font>

1369
02:07:27.376 --> 02:07:29.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Saatnya membawamu kembali ke istana</b></font>

1370
02:07:32.959 --> 02:07:34.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa yang kau ketahui tentang ayahmu?</b></font>

1371
02:07:36.626 --> 02:07:37.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Nihil.</b></font>

1372
02:07:38.459 --> 02:07:41.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Cuma kisah perang. tiada kabar soal
nasibnya seusai Troya.</b></font>

1373
02:07:42.876 --> 02:07:44.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Maafkan aku. Ibu.</b></font>

1374
02:07:44.959 --> 02:07:49.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di Sparta. cuma membahas soal bencana 
yang mengintai.</b></font>

1375
02:07:49.542 --> 02:07:53.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>zaman kelam yang akan disulut Bangsa Laut
dengan melanggar hukum Zeus</b></font>

1376
02:07:53.876 --> 02:07:55.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jadi memang benar.</b></font>

1377
02:07:55.376 --> 02:07:57.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>peradaban kita tengah runtuh</b></font>

1378
02:07:57.876 --> 02:08:00.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Menelaus bilang kita lemah dengan takhta
kosong ini</b></font>

1379
02:08:01.209 --> 02:08:02.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>jadi kita susun strategi.</b></font>

1380
02:08:04.292 --> 02:08:05.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Strategi</b></font>

1381
02:08:07.542 --> 02:08:09.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Untuk mengusir para pelamar.</b></font>

1382
02:08:12.126 --> 02:08:13.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ibu harus menentukan pilihan.</b></font>

1383
02:08:17.459 --> 02:08:19.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau ingin Ibu menikah lagi?</b></font>

1384
02:08:19.542 --> 02:08:22.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lalu. pelamar lainnya 
akan pergi</b></font>

1385
02:08:22.459 --> 02:08:24.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan hanya tersisa satu lawan.</b></font>

1386
02:08:25.042 --> 02:08:29.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Saat sudah dewasa. kuberitahu Tetua. 
Odisseus wafat.</b></font>

1387
02:08:29.709 --> 02:08:32.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan Menelaus akan yakinkan mereka
memberi takhta itu padaku</b></font>

1388
02:08:32.876 --> 02:08:36.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau sangkal ayahmu 
dan ibu pergi dengan si bajingan</b></font>

1389
02:08:36.702 --> 02:08:38.701
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Cemerlang!
- Punya ide yang lebih baik?</b></font>

1390
02:08:42.042 --> 02:08:43.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kunci semua pintu. bakar ruangannya</b></font>

1391
02:08:43.959 --> 02:08:45.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan panggang bajingan itu.</b></font>

1392
02:08:46.515 --> 02:08:50.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau pikir jika ibu menikah lagi.
hidup akan pulih seperti sedia kala?</b></font>

1393
02:08:51.626 --> 02:08:53.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dunia ini tamat.</b></font>

1394
02:08:53.542 --> 02:08:54.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dan di dunia baru ini.</b></font>

1395
02:08:55.042 --> 02:08:57.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>mereka takkan menyerahkan kuasa 
padamu atau Odisseus.</b></font>

1396
02:08:58.126 --> 02:09:00.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bila ayahmu pulang. dia harus membunuhnya.</b></font>

1397
02:09:00.626 --> 02:09:02.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Seperti halnya kau kelak.</b></font>

1398
02:09:02.459 --> 02:09:03.474
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bila aku membunuhnya.</b></font>

1399
02:09:03.626 --> 02:09:06.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>keluarganya akan menuntut balas. 
dan aku akan diasingkan.</b></font>

1400
02:09:07.542 --> 02:09:09.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tanpa aku. takhta itu akan lenyap.</b></font>

1401
02:09:09.292 --> 02:09:11.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hanya seorang pria 
yang berhak bertakhta</b></font>

1402
02:09:12.542 --> 02:09:13.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>"Takhta kosong"?</b></font>

1403
02:09:15.459 --> 02:09:18.813
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ibu menduduki takhta kosong ini 
selama 20 tahun</b></font>

1404
02:09:18.886 --> 02:09:21.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pengetahuan Ibu.
selama bertahun-tahun.</b></font>

1405
02:09:21.542 --> 02:09:24.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dianggap tak berharga 
di matamu.</b></font>

1406
02:09:26.876 --> 02:09:28.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ibu mendambakan kedamaian</b></font>

1407
02:09:28.709 --> 02:09:29.808
<font color="#fff22f"><b>atau balas dendam?</b></font>

1408
02:09:29.876 --> 02:09:30.891
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ibu mendambakan Odisseus!</b></font>

1409
02:09:34.459 --> 02:09:35.558
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bernyanyilah.</b></font>

1410
02:09:35.980 --> 02:09:37.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>oh. pujangga. raut wajah!</b></font>

1411
02:09:40.209 --> 02:09:41.224
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Wajah!</b></font>

1412
02:09:46.042 --> 02:09:47.058
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Armada!</b></font>

1413
02:09:51.292 --> 02:09:52.350
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Perang!</b></font>

1414
02:09:56.413 --> 02:09:57.853
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dan Troya!</b></font>

1415
02:10:01.483 --> 02:10:03.360
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bernyanyilah .wahai muse 
tentang seorang pria!</b></font>

1416
02:10:07.309 --> 02:10:08.449
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Seorang pria!</b></font>

1417
02:10:12.459 --> 02:10:13.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pemikiran!</b></font>

1418
02:10:17.376 --> 02:10:18.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tipu daya!</b></font>

1419
02:10:22.042 --> 02:10:23.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Eumaeus. pergilah dahulu.</b></font>

1420
02:10:30.292 --> 02:10:31.391
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Argos</b></font>

1421
02:10:53.042 --> 02:10:55.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kuburkan dia di tebing</b></font>

1422
02:10:56.876 --> 02:10:58.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di mana kalian saling bertemu?</b></font>

1423
02:11:06.459 --> 02:11:07.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau Odisseus</b></font>

1424
02:11:10.709 --> 02:11:12.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau ayahku.</b></font>

1425
02:11:14.709 --> 02:11:15.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku pengemis</b></font>

1426
02:11:19.209 --> 02:11:20.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dan kau.</b></font>

1427
02:11:22.209 --> 02:11:23.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>kau putra.</b></font>

1428
02:11:24.792 --> 02:11:26.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>kebanggaan</b></font>

1429
02:11:26.542 --> 02:11:27.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Odisseus.</b></font>

1430
02:11:29.542 --> 02:11:30.641
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Seorang putra yang...</b></font>

1431
02:11:31.126 --> 02:11:33.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>saat kalian akhirnya bersua.</b></font>

1432
02:11:35.042 --> 02:11:36.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>akan membuatnya bangga.</b></font>

1433
02:11:40.709 --> 02:11:41.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Selamat datang</b></font>

1434
02:11:42.542 --> 02:11:43.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>musafir.</b></font>

1435
02:11:46.959 --> 02:11:49.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Masa kelam kemenangan</b></font>

1436
02:11:50.126 --> 02:11:52.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>menyelimuti para penutur kisah</b></font>

1437
02:11:54.209 --> 02:11:57.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan menyulap kita menjadi pujangga 
tuna netra yang mengemis.</b></font>

1438
02:12:04.792 --> 02:12:06.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Terimalah keramahan Zeus</b></font>

1439
02:12:07.542 --> 02:12:09.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Beri orang asing ini makan.</b></font>

1440
02:12:09.459 --> 02:12:10.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tidak usah. Tuanku</b></font>

1441
02:12:11.376 --> 02:12:13.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku akan mengemis dari meja ke meja
dengan mangkukku</b></font>

1442
02:12:19.126 --> 02:12:21.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau sudi menjamu lagi
 lintah darat menjijikkan?</b></font>

1443
02:12:21.959 --> 02:12:24.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sekadar satu pengemis 
tambahan di sini.</b></font>

1444
02:12:42.626 --> 02:12:45.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ayo bunuh dia sebelum
 mempengaruhi Tetua.</b></font>

1445
02:12:45.459 --> 02:12:46.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Caranya?</b></font>

1446
02:13:04.209 --> 02:13:05.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pancing dia.</b></font>

1447
02:13:05.876 --> 02:13:07.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>buat dia memegang senjata.</b></font>

1448
02:13:12.209 --> 02:13:15.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dia bukan bocah ingusan
 untuk diintimidasi</b></font>

1449
02:13:15.292 --> 02:13:17.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Maka. kita kembali malam ini 
untuk menyembelihnya.</b></font>

1450
02:13:19.270 --> 02:13:21.150
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Enyah kau. 
- Beri ampun.</b></font>

1451
02:13:21.876 --> 02:13:24.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Aku kelaparan. 
- Enyah kau!</b></font>

1452
02:13:24.292 --> 02:13:27.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tak bisakah kau bermurah hati dengan
makanan orang lain?</b></font>

1453
02:13:29.709 --> 02:13:31.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Tak ada tempat lagi di mangkukmu
- Ya.Tuan</b></font>

1454
02:13:38.542 --> 02:13:39.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Benar.</b></font>

1455
02:13:41.209 --> 02:13:42.308
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ini.</b></font>

1456
02:13:46.876 --> 02:13:49.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau membayangkan 
aku punya sesuatu untukmu?</b></font>

1457
02:13:50.459 --> 02:13:52.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Malah aku yang punya sesuatu untukmu.</b></font>

1458
02:13:53.376 --> 02:13:55.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau punya sesuatu untukku?</b></font>

1459
02:13:56.292 --> 02:13:57.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia punya sesuatu untukku!</b></font>

1460
02:13:58.959 --> 02:14:02.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa yang dipunyai 
lintah darat menjijikkan sepertimu</b></font>

1461
02:14:02.459 --> 02:14:03.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>yang bisa menarik</b></font>

1462
02:14:04.042 --> 02:14:05.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>minatku?</b></font>

1463
02:14:05.292 --> 02:14:07.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sebenarnya. ini milikmu</b></font>

1464
02:14:12.959 --> 02:14:14.724
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku disuruh untuk mengembalikannya padamu.</b></font>

1465
02:14:16.792 --> 02:14:17.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bukan milikku.</b></font>

1466
02:14:19.542 --> 02:14:20.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Oh ya?</b></font>

1467
02:14:23.876 --> 02:14:24.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di mana kau menemukannya?</b></font>

1468
02:14:27.156 --> 02:14:29.094
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jangan berbalik!</b></font>

1469
02:14:34.042 --> 02:14:35.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Antinous</b></font>

1470
02:14:35.626 --> 02:14:38.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Hargai pengemis. 
- Itulah hukum Zeus.</b></font>

1471
02:14:38.876 --> 02:14:40.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hukum Zeus?</b></font>

1472
02:14:44.376 --> 02:14:45.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pantaskah dia jadi dewa?</b></font>

1473
02:14:49.126 --> 02:14:50.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pantaskah dia jadi penjelmaan dewa?</b></font>

1474
02:14:51.709 --> 02:14:52.724
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Beritahu kami!</b></font>

1475
02:14:54.376 --> 02:14:55.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apakah kau dewa.</b></font>

1476
02:14:56.709 --> 02:14:57.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>lintah darat?</b></font>

1477
02:14:58.741 --> 02:14:59.968
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bukan.</b></font>

1478
02:15:00.376 --> 02:15:02.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku mantan serdadu 
Perang Troya.</b></font>

1479
02:15:02.959 --> 02:15:05.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mantan serdadu Perang Troya.</b></font>

1480
02:15:07.542 --> 02:15:09.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Siapa namamu. serdadu?</b></font>

1481
02:15:13.042 --> 02:15:14.058
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sinon.</b></font>

1482
02:15:17.542 --> 02:15:19.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau kenal nama itu?</b></font>

1483
02:15:20.404 --> 02:15:21.711
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tidak</b></font>

1484
02:15:22.376 --> 02:15:25.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku memakai nama itu untuk menghormati
pria muda yang paling berani</b></font>

1485
02:15:26.626 --> 02:15:27.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sinon?</b></font>

1486
02:15:29.292 --> 02:15:31.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bukankah itu putra gembala dombamu?</b></font>

1487
02:15:33.368 --> 02:15:34.450
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tak ingat.</b></font>

1488
02:15:34.482 --> 02:15:37.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ya. Ya. 
Dia minta kau untuk menggantikannya.</b></font>

1489
02:15:37.459 --> 02:15:39.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dari mana kau mendapatkannya?</b></font>

1490
02:15:39.209 --> 02:15:40.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di tempatmu akan berada kelak.</b></font>

1491
02:15:41.459 --> 02:15:42.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa itu?</b></font>

1492
02:15:43.376 --> 02:15:44.391
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Di alam Hades.</b></font>

1493
02:15:47.792 --> 02:15:48.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sudah cukup!</b></font>

1494
02:15:50.459 --> 02:15:52.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Perjamuan selesai!</b></font>

1495
02:15:56.042 --> 02:15:57.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kita cabut.</b></font>

1496
02:15:58.459 --> 02:15:59.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Itu bukan milikku!</b></font>

1497
02:16:08.042 --> 02:16:09.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ratu ingin berbincang denganmu</b></font>

1498
02:16:10.126 --> 02:16:13.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>saat ruangan kosong 
dan lentera dinyalakan.</b></font>

1499
02:17:05.459 --> 02:17:06.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Malam. musafir.</b></font>

1500
02:17:07.959 --> 02:17:09.040
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ratuku.</b></font>

1501
02:17:09.459 --> 02:17:10.558
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Melantho.</b></font>

1502
02:17:10.709 --> 02:17:13.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>suruh Euryclea 
membersihkan kaki musafir ini.</b></font>

1503
02:17:13.626 --> 02:17:14.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tak usah repot-repot.</b></font>

1504
02:17:15.209 --> 02:17:19.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Suamiku menjamu tamu 
layaknya keluarga sendiri.</b></font>

1505
02:17:19.541 --> 02:17:21.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau kenal Odisseus. 
suamiku?</b></font>

1506
02:17:22.209 --> 02:17:23.290
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pasti.</b></font>

1507
02:17:23.924 --> 02:17:25.144
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lewat nyanyian.</b></font>

1508
02:17:25.709 --> 02:17:27.290
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku di Troya. nyonyaku.</b></font>

1509
02:17:28.126 --> 02:17:30.540
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Nyanyian pasti terdengar konyol bagimu.</b></font>

1510
02:17:31.709 --> 02:17:33.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bikin aku menangis</b></font>

1511
02:17:34.376 --> 02:17:35.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa yang kau tangisi?</b></font>

1512
02:17:36.041 --> 02:17:37.540
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Yang telah hilang.</b></font>

1513
02:17:38.459 --> 02:17:39.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Nyawa?</b></font>

1514
02:17:40.376 --> 02:17:41.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dan waktu</b></font>

1515
02:17:42.959 --> 02:17:44.040
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan segalanya.</b></font>

1516
02:17:52.126 --> 02:17:54.290
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau kenal Odisseus di Troya?</b></font>

1517
02:17:54.876 --> 02:17:55.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ya.</b></font>

1518
02:17:56.876 --> 02:17:59.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa ada yang unik</b></font>

1519
02:17:59.459 --> 02:18:01.040
<font color="#fff22f"><b>pada bajunya?</b></font>

1520
02:18:01.876 --> 02:18:03.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bros yang unik.</b></font>

1521
02:18:04.459 --> 02:18:05.540
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aneh?</b></font>

1522
02:18:06.209 --> 02:18:07.308
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Menawan.</b></font>

1523
02:18:08.041 --> 02:18:09.540
<font color="#fff22f"><b>namun langka.</b></font>

1524
02:18:09.959 --> 02:18:11.058
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Jelaskan rupanya.</b></font>

1525
02:18:26.291 --> 02:18:27.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku ganti airnya dulu.</b></font>

1526
02:18:32.459 --> 02:18:34.040
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Itu bros emas</b></font>

1527
02:18:34.209 --> 02:18:35.540
<font color="#fff22f"><b>yang menawan</b></font>

1528
02:18:36.709 --> 02:18:39.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>bergambar Athena dibalut tanaman rambat</b></font>

1529
02:18:48.709 --> 02:18:50.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa dia sering memakainya?</b></font>

1530
02:18:51.959 --> 02:18:53.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tak pernah dia melepasnya.</b></font>

1531
02:19:14.626 --> 02:19:17.540
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mengapa kau bisa pulang. 
beda dengan Odisseus?</b></font>

1532
02:19:18.791 --> 02:19:21.290
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Akuu belum pulang. 
belum sepenuhnya.</b></font>

1533
02:19:22.209 --> 02:19:23.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kenapa?</b></font>

1534
02:19:23.806 --> 02:19:29.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pulang tak selalu mudah 
bagi Odisseus maupun diriku.</b></font>

1535
02:19:30.541 --> 02:19:32.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Odisseus yang kukenal</b></font>

1536
02:19:33.126 --> 02:19:35.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>pasti mampu kembali padaku</b></font>

1537
02:19:35.876 --> 02:19:37.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>menembus rintangan apa pun.</b></font>

1538
02:19:38.541 --> 02:19:41.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bagaimana jika Odisseus
yang kau kenal</b></font> <font color="#fff22f"><b>telah tersesat?</b></font>

1539
02:19:46.209 --> 02:19:47.290
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bagaimana jika.</b></font>

1540
02:19:48.376 --> 02:19:49.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>suatu malam.</b></font>

1541
02:19:50.542 --> 02:19:52.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>di kota asing.</b></font>

1542
02:19:53.709 --> 02:19:55.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>apa yang ia saksikan</b></font>

1543
02:19:56.292 --> 02:19:59.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>menyakinkan dirinya 
bahwa rumah</b></font>

1544
02:20:00.042 --> 02:20:02.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>tak lagi bisa ia temukan?</b></font>

1545
02:20:05.709 --> 02:20:06.724
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bagaimana jika.</b></font>

1546
02:20:07.292 --> 02:20:09.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>saat keluar dari perut kuda itu</b></font>

1547
02:20:13.221 --> 02:20:15.194
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan membuka gerbang Troya.</b></font>

1548
02:20:20.292 --> 02:20:22.898
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dia menyaksikan 1 dekade kemarahan</b></font>

1549
02:20:23.542 --> 02:20:25.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>membanjiri kota dalam semalam?</b></font>

1550
02:21:11.459 --> 02:21:12.558
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kemari semua!</b></font>

1551
02:21:13.042 --> 02:21:14.141
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Cepat!</b></font>

1552
02:22:37.876 --> 02:22:39.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kita beri mereka</b></font>

1553
02:22:39.876 --> 02:22:40.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>cenderamata.</b></font>

1554
02:22:41.542 --> 02:22:43.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>simbol perdamaian</b></font>

1555
02:22:43.876 --> 02:22:44.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>yang mereka bawa</b></font>

1556
02:22:45.542 --> 02:22:47.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>ke rumah mereka.</b></font>

1557
02:22:57.709 --> 02:23:00.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kita nodai hal paling suci</b></font>

1558
02:23:01.959 --> 02:23:03.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>antarmanusia</b></font>

1559
02:23:05.376 --> 02:23:06.824
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan mengubah perang jadi perburuan.</b></font>

1560
02:23:07.626 --> 02:23:08.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hancurkan berhala mereka!</b></font>

1561
02:23:10.876 --> 02:23:12.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>menjadi perburuan.</b></font>

1562
02:23:28.459 --> 02:23:30.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Membakar dinding Troya.</b></font>

1563
02:23:31.126 --> 02:23:33.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>berarti membakar seluruh dunia.</b></font>

1564
02:23:35.376 --> 02:23:37.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>termasuk rumah sendiri.</b></font>

1565
02:23:43.959 --> 02:23:45.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Seandainya dia tahu.</b></font>

1566
02:23:47.161 --> 02:23:48.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>malam itu.</b></font>

1567
02:23:51.709 --> 02:23:53.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>saat melintasi kobaran api</b></font>

1568
02:23:54.376 --> 02:23:56.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>anarki dan penderitaan.</b></font>

1569
02:24:46.709 --> 02:24:50.797
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dan di hari-hari perayaan 
yang penuh keringat..</b></font>

1570
02:24:56.709 --> 02:24:58.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>seandainya dia tahu pasti</b></font>

1571
02:24:59.126 --> 02:25:00.250
<font color="#fff22f"><b>apa yang telah ia lakukan?</b></font>

1572
02:25:19.126 --> 02:25:20.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Apa yang kalian semua lakukan.</b></font>

1573
02:25:21.126 --> 02:25:22.901
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Gagasan seorang pria.</b></font>

1574
02:25:24.459 --> 02:25:26.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>tipu daya satu orang.</b></font>

1575
02:25:27.626 --> 02:25:29.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>untuk melanggar hukum Zeus</b></font>

1576
02:25:29.542 --> 02:25:30.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>selamanya.</b></font>

1577
02:25:31.709 --> 02:25:33.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kita tinggal di dunia istana.</b></font>

1578
02:25:34.042 --> 02:25:35.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>perdagangan</b></font>

1579
02:25:36.709 --> 02:25:37.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan bahasa.</b></font>

1580
02:25:38.126 --> 02:25:39.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kita buta akan keindahannya.</b></font>

1581
02:25:40.792 --> 02:25:42.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>sampai kita menghancurkannya.</b></font>

1582
02:25:44.709 --> 02:25:47.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kalianlah Bangsa Laut.</b></font>

1583
02:25:49.376 --> 02:25:50.474
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ya. Ratuku.</b></font>

1584
02:25:52.197 --> 02:25:55.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pelanggaran hukum Zeus 
menyebar bagai wabah.</b></font>

1585
02:25:55.709 --> 02:25:57.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>zaman perunggu kita runtuh.</b></font>

1586
02:25:57.542 --> 02:26:01.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mungkin dia tak ingin melihat
 puing tindakannya</b></font>

1587
02:26:01.542 --> 02:26:02.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>di mana pun</b></font>

1588
02:26:02.876 --> 02:26:04.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>apalagi di rumahnya sendiri.</b></font>

1589
02:26:14.126 --> 02:26:15.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Namun Odisseus hidup</b></font>

1590
02:26:17.792 --> 02:26:19.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan akan menemuimu di saat krusial.</b></font>

1591
02:26:21.709 --> 02:26:22.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bagaimanapun juga.</b></font>

1592
02:26:24.542 --> 02:26:27.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku sudah cukup lama hidup 
di reruntuhannya.</b></font>

1593
02:26:32.459 --> 02:26:35.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Undang pelamar saat fajar. 
sita senjata mereka.</b></font>

1594
02:26:35.709 --> 02:26:39.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sebentar lagi. satu pelamar bahagia 
dan yang lain akan murka.</b></font>

1595
02:26:40.292 --> 02:26:42.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Senjata dilarang selama kompetisi</b></font>

1596
02:26:42.626 --> 02:26:44.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan pintunya akan dikunci.</b></font>

1597
02:26:44.876 --> 02:26:47.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku akan menikahi 
pemenang tantanganku.</b></font>

1598
02:26:53.709 --> 02:26:55.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bagaimana kita menghadapi mereka?</b></font>

1599
02:26:56.209 --> 02:26:57.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bukan "kita"</b></font>

1600
02:26:58.042 --> 02:26:59.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Darah mereka akan tumpah di tanganku.</b></font>

1601
02:27:00.376 --> 02:27:02.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dan kau. kau berisiko diasingkan.</b></font>

1602
02:27:02.876 --> 02:27:03.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau tidak?</b></font>

1603
02:27:04.792 --> 02:27:06.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Singkirkan senjata dari jangkauan mereka.</b></font>

1604
02:27:07.126 --> 02:27:08.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Baik.</b></font>

1605
02:27:08.792 --> 02:27:11.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Biar tanpa senjata. 
mereka tetap banyak</b></font>

1606
02:27:11.626 --> 02:27:13.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan kau takkan bersenjata</b></font>

1607
02:27:14.626 --> 02:27:16.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku akan bersenjata</b></font>

1608
02:27:17.626 --> 02:27:19.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ibumu sudah mengaturnya</b></font>

1609
02:27:21.626 --> 02:27:23.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bawa pelayan kepercayaanmu</b></font>

1610
02:27:23.792 --> 02:27:25.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>untuk mengunci senjata di lantai atas</b></font>

1611
02:27:44.209 --> 02:27:45.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Cepat. bawa senjatanya.</b></font>

1612
02:27:54.042 --> 02:27:55.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Cepat.</b></font>

1613
02:28:17.113 --> 02:28:19.249
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Saat penentuan.</b></font>
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Zeus sepertinya tertarik</b></font>

1614
02:28:19.274 --> 02:28:20.956
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kompetisi apa ini?</b></font>

1615
02:28:44.126 --> 02:28:45.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bertahun-tahun lamanya.</b></font>

1616
02:28:46.709 --> 02:28:48.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>saat suamiku pergi.</b></font>

1617
02:28:49.292 --> 02:28:52.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>kalian menguasai istana ini
untuk pesta pora.</b></font>

1618
02:28:52.959 --> 02:28:56.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dengan alasan ingin melamarku.</b></font>

1619
02:28:59.876 --> 02:29:01.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mendengar kalian berpesta</b></font>

1620
02:29:03.626 --> 02:29:04.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>berkelahi.</b></font>

1621
02:29:06.459 --> 02:29:08.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>menyogok pelayan-pelayanku</b></font>

1622
02:29:08.626 --> 02:29:10.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan menodai rumahku.</b></font>

1623
02:29:11.042 --> 02:29:15.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>aku sangat mendamba Odisseus pulang
dan melihat ini semua</b></font>

1624
02:29:22.542 --> 02:29:23.691
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Namun tadi malam.</b></font>

1625
02:29:24.626 --> 02:29:25.741
<font color="#fff22f"><b>aku sadar</b></font>

1626
02:29:26.126 --> 02:29:28.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>jika dia belum muncul juga.</b></font>

1627
02:29:30.959 --> 02:29:32.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dia takkan pernah pulang.</b></font>

1628
02:29:34.209 --> 02:29:35.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Oleh karena itu.</b></font>

1629
02:29:36.292 --> 02:29:39.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>aku siap menikah 
dengan siapa pun di sini</b></font>

1630
02:29:39.876 --> 02:29:42.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>yang mampu menarik busur ini</b></font>

1631
02:29:42.292 --> 02:29:45.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan menembakkan panah 
melewati 12 kapak ini.</b></font>

1632
02:29:47.459 --> 02:29:48.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tunjukkan dirimu.</b></font>

1633
02:29:50.459 --> 02:29:51.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>buktikan nyalimu</b></font>

1634
02:29:53.542 --> 02:29:54.583
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Eumaeus?</b></font>

1635
02:30:06.792 --> 02:30:08.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Siapa yang mulai?</b></font>

1636
02:30:08.459 --> 02:30:10.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Beri aku busur itu.</b></font>

1637
02:30:30.876 --> 02:30:32.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sia-sia saja.</b></font>

1638
02:30:32.376 --> 02:30:33.474
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Bagimu.</b></font>

1639
02:30:33.876 --> 02:30:36.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dulu. Odisseus menariknya 
dengan enteng.</b></font>

1640
02:30:36.209 --> 02:30:37.241
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kalau begitu. lakukanlah</b></font>

1641
02:30:38.126 --> 02:30:39.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Akuu menunggu giliran.</b></font>

1642
02:30:40.542 --> 02:30:43.373
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kenapa tak dipanaskan 
dan diminyaki talinya?</b></font>

1643
02:30:44.376 --> 02:30:46.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tali itu sudah kering
 dimakan usia</b></font>

1644
02:31:21.376 --> 02:31:22.474
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Giliranmu.</b></font>

1645
02:31:22.876 --> 02:31:23.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Percuma.</b></font>

1646
02:31:27.292 --> 02:31:28.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ratuku punya keputusan final.</b></font>

1647
02:31:29.376 --> 02:31:30.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>tak ada yang bisa menggantikan Odisseus</b></font>

1648
02:31:31.209 --> 02:31:32.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Beberapa orang di sini sudah tahu</b></font>

1649
02:31:32.959 --> 02:31:35.791
<font color="#fff22f"><b>dan mereka akan mengikuti pria hebat itu
ke Troya.</b></font>

1650
02:31:36.042 --> 02:31:37.458
<font color="#fff22f"><b>jika saja dia menghendakinya.</b></font>

1651
02:31:40.042 --> 02:31:41.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Namun dia tak pulang.</b></font>

1652
02:31:43.709 --> 02:31:45.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>jadi pilihlah yang terbaik di antara kami.</b></font>

1653
02:31:47.042 --> 02:31:49.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>kami yang gagal di tantanganmu.</b></font>

1654
02:31:49.959 --> 02:31:51.291
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku belum gagal</b></font>

1655
02:31:56.363 --> 02:31:58.423
Tendang pengemis itu keluar!

1656
02:31:59.126 --> 02:32:02.405
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pintu sudah terkunci
sampai akhir kompetisi</b></font>

1657
02:32:02.540 --> 02:32:04.247
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kompetisi sudah usai</b></font>

1658
02:32:05.150 --> 02:32:06.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Aku ingin coba.</b></font>

1659
02:32:06.796 --> 02:32:08.210
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau membuang waktu saja!</b></font>

1660
02:32:09.626 --> 02:32:11.541
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia punya hak untuk mencoba.</b></font>

1661
02:32:12.792 --> 02:32:15.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kalau kau mundur. 
berikan jatahmu padanya.</b></font>

1662
02:32:15.626 --> 02:32:17.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau menghina hasrat ibumu sendiri.</b></font>

1663
02:32:17.792 --> 02:32:20.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Hasratnya adalah kalian semua 
terbakar habis.</b></font>

1664
02:32:31.626 --> 02:32:33.958
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pemanah itu sudah tua renta.</b></font>

1665
02:32:38.709 --> 02:32:40.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Mari saksikan sang ahli beraksi.</b></font>

1666
02:32:40.959 --> 02:32:42.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lintah darat!</b></font>

1667
02:32:44.876 --> 02:32:46.624
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Lupakan saja. pak tua!</b></font>

1668
02:32:57.709 --> 02:32:58.808
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ayo. kawan.</b></font>

1669
02:32:59.376 --> 02:33:00.474
<font color="#fff22f"><b>sudah cukup</b></font>

1670
02:33:00.792 --> 02:33:02.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Biarkan dia mencoba</b></font>

1671
02:33:44.292 --> 02:33:45.374
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Kau Odisseus.</b></font>

1672
02:33:52.126 --> 02:33:54.041
<font color="#fff22f"><b>sebaiknya kau tetap di bawah</b></font>

1673
02:34:07.876 --> 02:34:11.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Itu dia?</b></font>

1674
02:34:20.459 --> 02:34:21.558
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pergi jaga senjatanya!</b></font>

1675
02:34:35.792 --> 02:34:38.124
<font color="#fff22f"><b>- Di mana senjatanya? 
- Di lantai atas</b></font>

1676
02:34:38.376 --> 02:34:39.391
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Cepat cari!</b></font>

1677
02:34:43.792 --> 02:34:45.208
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Tunggu apa lagi?</b></font>

1678
02:34:45.376 --> 02:34:46.874
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Dia akan membunuh kita semua!</b></font>

1679
02:34:50.209 --> 02:34:51.308
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Awas!</b></font>

1680
02:34:56.292 --> 02:34:58.917
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Sudah kubilang. 
Enyah kau. gembala babi!</b></font>

1681
02:35:09.376 --> 02:35:10.408
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ya!</b></font>

1682
02:35:21.188 --> 02:35:22.421
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Pergi!</b></font>

1683
02:36:15.626 --> 02:36:16.708
<font color="#fff22f"><b>Ambil pedangnya!</b></font>

1684
02:37:14.959 --> 02:37:16.374
